(window.AFYA_TX=window.AFYA_TX||{})["mr"]={"mr_walk_stick":[["An adjustable walking stick takes up to a quarter of body weight off a painful leg and gives a second point of contact that steadies balance. It is held in the hand opposite the sore side and moves forward together with the weak leg. Set the height so the handle sits level with the wrist crease when the arm hangs relaxed, giving a slight bend at the elbow; a stick that is too tall pushes the shoulder up, one that is too short makes the user stoop. Choose an aluminium push-button stick with a firm rubber ferrule, and replace the ferrule as soon as the tread wears smooth, because a worn tip slips on wet tiles. A folding model suits people who only need support outdoors or when travelling by daladala, while a fixed L-handle stick is sturdier for all-day use. Afya stocks them because a correctly fitted stick is the cheapest, most effective fall-prevention device there is.","Fimbo ya kutembelea inayorekebishwa hupunguza hadi robo ya uzito wa mwili kwenye mguu unaouma na kuongeza kituo cha pili cha kugusa ardhi kinachoimarisha mizani. Hushikwa kwa mkono wa upande usiouma na husogezwa mbele pamoja na mguu dhaifu. Weka urefu ili mshiko ulingane na mkunjo wa kifundo cha mkono mkono ukining’inia kwa utulivu, kiwiko kikipinda kidogo; fimbo ndefu mno huinua bega, na fupi mno humfanya mtumiaji ainame. Chagua fimbo ya alumini yenye kitufe cha kurekebisha na kifuniko imara cha mpira chini, na ubadilishe kifuniko hicho mara kinapoisha mikunjo, kwa sababu kifuniko kilichochakaa huteleza kwenye vigae vyenye maji. Fimbo inayokunjwa inafaa wanaohitaji msaada nje tu au wanaposafiri kwa daladala, wakati fimbo ya mshiko wa L isiyokunjwa ni imara zaidi kwa matumizi ya siku nzima. Afya inaziuza kwa sababu fimbo iliyorekebishwa vizuri ndiyo kifaa cha bei nafuu na chenye ufanisi mkubwa zaidi cha kuzuia kuanguka."],["Every older customer and every sprained ankle is a buyer; low price, fast turnover and an easy add-on of spare ferrules","Kila mteja mzee na kila aliyeteguka ni mnunuzi; bei nafuu, mzunguko wa haraka na nyongeza rahisi ya vifuniko vya ziada"]],"mr_walk_quad":[["A tripod or quadripod stick has a small base with three or four rubber feet, so it stands on its own and gives a broader, steadier support than a single-point stick. It is the usual choice after a stroke, when one side of the body is weak and the person needs to lean more weight through the hand. All the feet must touch the ground together for the stick to be stable, so it works best on level floors and is awkward on stairs, rough murram paths or steep slopes. Set the height at the wrist crease, keep the flat side of the base towards the user so it does not catch the foot, and check the four ferrules monthly for wear. A physiotherapist should confirm that a base stick, rather than a frame, is the right level of support. Afya stocks both bases because stroke and hypertension are common in Tanzania and families usually buy these on the day of discharge.","Fimbo ya miguu mitatu au minne ina kitako kidogo chenye nyayo za mpira tatu au nne, hivyo husimama yenyewe na kutoa msaada mpana na thabiti kuliko fimbo ya ncha moja. Ndiyo chaguo la kawaida baada ya kiharusi, upande mmoja wa mwili unapokuwa dhaifu na mtu anahitaji kuegemeza uzito zaidi kupitia mkono. Nyayo zote lazima ziguse ardhi kwa pamoja ili fimbo iwe imara, hivyo inafaa zaidi sakafu tambarare na haifai sana ngazini, njia za changarawe au miteremko mikali. Weka urefu kwenye mkunjo wa kifundo cha mkono, upande bapa wa kitako uelekee mtumiaji ili usinase mguu, na kagua vifuniko vinne vya mpira kila mwezi. Mtaalamu wa tiba ya viungo athibitishe kama fimbo ya kitako, badala ya fremu, ndiyo kiwango sahihi cha msaada. Afya inauza aina zote mbili kwa sababu kiharusi na shinikizo la damu ni vya kawaida Tanzania na familia mara nyingi hununua siku mgonjwa anaporuhusiwa kutoka hospitali."],["Bought on hospital discharge day by worried families; clear upgrade path from the single stick","Hununuliwa siku ya kuruhusiwa hospitalini na familia zenye wasiwasi; ni hatua inayofuata baada ya fimbo ya kawaida"]],"mr_walk_ua":[["Underarm crutches let a person keep all weight off one leg for the weeks a fracture or ligament injury needs to heal. The top pad should sit two to three finger-widths below the armpit and the hand grip level with the wrist crease; weight is taken through the hands, never by hanging on the armpit, which can injure the nerves of the arm. They are easier to learn than elbow crutches and are the usual choice for young, fit adults with a cast or boot. Check that height and grip are adjustable with locking pins, that the pads and ferrules are intact, and replace worn ferrules immediately. Most people use a pair for four to eight weeks, which is why many families prefer to buy rather than borrow. Afya stocks them because road-traffic and sports injuries are frequent, and a pair is needed the same day the cast goes on.","Magongo ya kwapani humwezesha mtu kutoweka uzito wowote kwenye mguu mmoja kwa wiki zinazohitajika mfupa uliovunjika au kano kupona. Mto wa juu ukae vidole viwili hadi vitatu chini ya kwapa na mshiko ulingane na kifundo cha mkono; uzito hubebwa na mikono, kamwe si kwa kuning’inia kwapani, jambo linaloweza kuumiza mishipa ya fahamu ya mkono. Ni rahisi kujifunza kuliko magongo ya kiwiko na ni chaguo la kawaida kwa vijana wenye nguvu waliowekewa plasta ngumu au buti. Hakikisha urefu na mshiko vinarekebishwa kwa pini za kufunga, mito na vifuniko vya chini viko salama, na ubadilishe vifuniko vilivyochakaa mara moja. Watu wengi hutumia jozi moja kwa wiki nne hadi nane, ndiyo sababu familia nyingi hupendelea kununua kuliko kuazima. Afya inayauza kwa sababu majeraha ya ajali za barabarani na michezo ni mengi, na jozi huhitajika siku ileile plasta inapowekwa."],["Urgent, same-day purchase after fractures; modest price with steady demand from boda-boda and sports injuries","Ununuzi wa haraka siku ileile baada ya kuvunjika; bei ya wastani na mahitaji ya kudumu kutokana na majeraha ya bodaboda na michezo"]],"mr_walk_elbow":[["Elbow crutches have a cuff that wraps the forearm and a moulded hand grip, so the user can release the grip to open a door without dropping the crutch. They are lighter and more discreet than underarm crutches and suit long-term conditions, polio or cerebral palsy, and people recovering from hip or knee replacement. They need more upper-body strength and balance, so a frail older person may be safer with a frame. Set the grip at wrist-crease height and the cuff about two-thirds of the way up the forearm, below the elbow; choose anodised aluminium with soft ergonomic grips and replaceable ferrules. A good pair lasts years if the ferrules are changed when worn. Afya stocks a value and a mid-priced pair because these are frequently replaced by long-term users who know exactly what they want.","Magongo ya kiwiko yana kishikio kinachozunguka mkono wa mbele na mshiko uliofinyangwa, hivyo mtumiaji anaweza kuachia mshiko ili kufungua mlango bila gongo kuanguka. Ni mepesi na hayaonekani sana kuliko magongo ya kwapani na yanafaa hali za muda mrefu, polio au mtindio wa ubongo, na wanaopona baada ya kubadilishwa nyonga au goti. Yanahitaji nguvu zaidi ya sehemu ya juu ya mwili na mizani, hivyo mzee dhaifu anaweza kuwa salama zaidi akitumia fremu. Weka mshiko kwenye urefu wa kifundo cha mkono na kishikio karibu theluthi mbili juu ya mkono wa mbele, chini ya kiwiko; chagua alumini iliyopakwa yenye mishiko laini na vifuniko vya chini vinavyobadilishwa. Jozi nzuri hudumu miaka ikiwa vifuniko vinabadilishwa vinapochakaa. Afya inauza jozi ya bei nafuu na ya bei ya kati kwa sababu watumiaji wa muda mrefu huzibadilisha mara kwa mara na wanajua hasa wanachotaka."],["Loyal long-term users who return for replacements and ferrules; higher margin than underarm crutches","Watumiaji waaminifu wa muda mrefu wanaorudi kununua mapya na vifuniko; faida kubwa kuliko magongo ya kwapani"]],"mr_walk_frame":[["A walking frame gives the widest, most stable support of any walking aid and is the standard first device after hip fracture or joint replacement. A standard frame is lifted and placed forward with each step, which is slow but very safe; a frame with two front wheels glides forward and suits people who cannot lift it repeatedly. Set the hand grips at wrist-crease height, keep the user standing inside the frame rather than pushing it far ahead, and fit fresh ferrules on the back legs. Folding aluminium frames store easily in small homes and fit in a car boot. WHO lists walking frames among its priority assistive products, and in Tanzania falls are a leading cause of injury in older adults. Afya stocks a value frame, a wheeled frame and a premium model because families often buy one for the hospital ward and keep it for home.","Fremu ya kutembelea hutoa msaada mpana na thabiti kuliko kifaa kingine chochote cha kutembelea na ndiyo kifaa cha kwanza cha kawaida baada ya kuvunjika nyonga au kubadilishwa kiungo. Fremu ya kawaida huinuliwa na kuwekwa mbele kila hatua, jambo la polepole lakini salama sana; fremu yenye magurudumu mawili ya mbele huteleza mbele na inafaa watu wasioweza kuiinua mara kwa mara. Weka mishiko kwenye urefu wa kifundo cha mkono, mtumiaji asimame ndani ya fremu badala ya kuisukuma mbali mbele, na weka vifuniko vipya kwenye miguu ya nyuma. Fremu za alumini zinazokunjwa huhifadhiwa kwa urahisi katika nyumba ndogo na huingia kwenye buti ya gari. Shirika la Afya Duniani linaorodhesha fremu za kutembelea miongoni mwa vifaa saidizi vya kipaumbele, na nchini Tanzania kuanguka ni chanzo kikuu cha majeraha kwa wazee. Afya inauza fremu ya bei nafuu, fremu yenye magurudumu na ya hadhi ya juu kwa sababu familia mara nyingi hununua moja kwa ajili ya wodini na kuendelea kuitumia nyumbani."],["High-ticket item with a clear medical trigger; strong word-of-mouth from hospital wards","Bidhaa ya bei kubwa yenye sababu ya wazi ya kitabibu; husambaa kwa mdomo kutoka wodini"]],"mr_walk_roll":[["A rollator is a four-wheeled walker with hand brakes, a fold-down seat and often a basket, so the user can walk to the market or around the compound and sit whenever breathless or tired. It suits people with heart or lung disease, arthritis or Parkinson’s who have reasonable balance but poor stamina; it is not for someone who must lean heavily, because the wheels can roll away. Before every walk check that both brakes lock firmly, and always lock them before sitting down. Choose a frame height that matches the wrist crease, wheels of at least 15 cm for rough paths, and a weight limit that suits the user. Fold-flat models fit into a car boot. Afya stocks rollators because they restore independence outside the home and are a popular family gift for elders.","Roleta ni kifaa cha kutembelea chenye magurudumu manne, breki za mkono, kiti kinachokunjwa na mara nyingi kikapu, hivyo mtumiaji anaweza kutembea hadi sokoni au kuzunguka uwanja na kuketi wakati wowote anapoishiwa pumzi au kuchoka. Inafaa watu wenye magonjwa ya moyo au mapafu, baridi yabisi au ugonjwa wa Parkinson wenye mizani nzuri kiasi lakini nguvu ndogo; haifai mtu anayelazimika kuegemea sana, kwa sababu magurudumu yanaweza kuteleza. Kabla ya kila matembezi hakikisha breki zote mbili zinashika vizuri, na daima zifunge kabla ya kuketi. Chagua urefu unaolingana na kifundo cha mkono, magurudumu ya angalau sentimita 15 kwa njia zisizo tambarare, na kiwango cha uzito kinachomfaa mtumiaji. Aina zinazokunjwa bapa huingia kwenye buti ya gari. Afya inauza roleta kwa sababu zinarudisha uhuru wa kutoka nje ya nyumba na ni zawadi inayopendwa na familia kwa wazee."],["Aspirational gift for elders with a strong margin; few local shops display them","Zawadi ya kuvutia kwa wazee yenye faida nzuri; maduka machache ya hapa nchini huzionyesha"]],"mr_chair_fold":[["A folding self-propelled wheelchair has large rear wheels with hand rims so the user can push themselves, while a transit (attendant) chair has small wheels and is pushed by a carer; both fold to fit a car boot or bajaji. The seat width should leave about two fingers of space each side of the hips, the footplates should keep the thighs level, and the user should be able to reach the hand rims comfortably. Check the weight limit, brakes on both wheels, removable or flip-up footrests and puncture-proof tyres for rough roads. Anyone who sits for many hours needs a pressure-relief cushion, because the standard sling seat causes sores. WHO wheelchair guidelines stress that a chair should be fitted to the person and that the user and carer should be shown how to use it safely. Afya offers value, lightweight and heavy-duty options so a family can match the chair to the person, the home and the budget.","Kiti cha magurudumu kinachokunjwa cha kujisukuma kina magurudumu makubwa ya nyuma yenye pete za mkono ili mtumiaji ajisukume mwenyewe, wakati kiti cha kusukumwa kina magurudumu madogo na husukumwa na mhudumu; vyote hukunjwa na kuingia kwenye buti ya gari au bajaji. Upana wa kiti uache nafasi ya vidole viwili kila upande wa nyonga, vikanyagio vya miguu viweke mapaja sawa, na mtumiaji afikie pete za mkono kwa urahisi. Kagua kiwango cha uzito, breki kwenye magurudumu yote mawili, vikanyagio vinavyoondolewa au kukunjwa juu na matairi yasiyotoboka kwa barabara mbovu. Yeyote anayeketi kwa saa nyingi anahitaji mto wa kupunguza mgandamizo, kwa sababu kiti cha kitambaa cha kawaida husababisha vidonda. Miongozo ya Shirika la Afya Duniani kuhusu viti vya magurudumu inasisitiza kwamba kiti kimfae mtu na mtumiaji na mhudumu waonyeshwe jinsi ya kukitumia kwa usalama. Afya inatoa chaguo la bei nafuu, jepesi na la kazi nzito ili familia ilinganishe kiti na mtu, nyumba na bajeti."],["Highest-value line in the zone; one sale often brings cushions, commode and grab bars with it","Bidhaa ya thamani kubwa zaidi katika eneo hili; mauzo moja mara nyingi huleta mto, choo cha kiti na vishikio pamoja nayo"]],"mr_chair_recl":[["A reclining high-back wheelchair supports the head and trunk and tilts back so a person with little sitting balance, such as after a major stroke or with advanced illness, can be moved safely and rest without being returned to bed. Commode versions add a removable pan beneath a cut-out seat, so the same chair is used for toileting, which saves risky transfers. Check that the recline locks securely at each angle, that elevating leg rests are included, and that the pan and seat are easy to clean. These chairs are heavier and wider than standard models, so measure doorways before buying. Use a pressure cushion over the commode opening when it is not in use. Afya stocks them for families who are caring for a loved one at home, where they reduce carer strain and improve dignity.","Kiti cha magurudumu cha mgongo mrefu kinacholala hushikilia kichwa na kiwiliwili na huinama nyuma ili mtu asiye na mizani ya kukaa, kama baada ya kiharusi kikubwa au ugonjwa uliokithiri, ahamishwe kwa usalama na apumzike bila kurudishwa kitandani. Aina zenye choo huongeza chombo kinachoondolewa chini ya kiti chenye tundu, hivyo kiti hichohicho hutumika kujisaidia, jambo linaloepusha uhamisho hatari. Hakikisha kulala kunafungika imara katika kila pembe, vikanyagio vya miguu vinavyoinuliwa vimejumuishwa, na chombo na kiti ni rahisi kusafisha. Viti hivi ni vizito na vipana kuliko vya kawaida, hivyo pima milango kabla ya kununua. Tumia mto wa mgandamizo juu ya tundu la choo wakati halitumiki. Afya inaviuza kwa ajili ya familia zinazomuuguza mpendwa nyumbani, ambapo hupunguza mzigo wa mhudumu na kuongeza heshima ya mgonjwa."],["Answers a pressing home-care need with a high ticket; few competitors stock it","Hujibu hitaji kubwa la uuguzi wa nyumbani kwa bei kubwa; washindani wachache huviuza"]],"mr_chair_child":[["Children need a wheelchair sized to them: an adult chair is too wide and deep, so the child slumps, which harms posture, breathing and feeding. A small paediatric chair suits a child who can sit upright, while a supportive (cerebral palsy) chair adds a high back, head rest, lateral pads, a harness and tilt so a child with low muscle tone sits safely and can join family life. Measure hip width and thigh length and leave room for about a year of growth; check that straps are padded and buckles easy for carers. Cerebral palsy is one of the commonest childhood disabilities in Tanzania, and many families still carry older children because they cannot find a suitable chair. A physiotherapist or occupational therapist should help fit a supportive chair. Afya stocks these because the right chair transforms a child’s daily life and school attendance.","Watoto wanahitaji kiti cha magurudumu cha ukubwa wao: kiti cha mtu mzima ni kipana na kirefu mno, hivyo mtoto hujilegeza, jambo linaloathiri mkao, kupumua na kula. Kiti kidogo cha watoto kinafaa mtoto anayeweza kukaa wima, wakati kiti cha kushikilia (cha mtindio wa ubongo) huongeza mgongo mrefu, egemeo la kichwa, mito ya pembeni, mkanda wa kifua na kuinama ili mtoto mwenye misuli dhaifu akae salama na ashiriki maisha ya familia. Pima upana wa nyonga na urefu wa paja na uache nafasi ya kukua kwa takriban mwaka mmoja; hakikisha mikanda ina mto na vifungo ni rahisi kwa wahudumu. Mtindio wa ubongo ni mojawapo ya ulemavu unaowapata watoto wengi zaidi Tanzania, na familia nyingi bado hubeba watoto wakubwa kwa sababu hawapati kiti kinachofaa. Mtaalamu wa tiba ya viungo au tiba ya kazi asaidie kurekebisha kiti cha kushikilia. Afya inaviuza kwa sababu kiti sahihi hubadilisha maisha ya kila siku ya mtoto na mahudhurio yake shuleni."],["Meets an underserved need with strong loyalty and referral from clinics and parent groups","Hujibu hitaji lisilohudumiwa vya kutosha, likileta uaminifu na rufaa kutoka kliniki na vikundi vya wazazi"]],"mr_chair_commode":[["A commode chair is a sturdy chair with a lidded seat and a removable bucket, placed beside the bed so a weak person can toilet without walking to the bathroom, which is when many night-time falls happen. Many models also go over a standard toilet as a raised seat with armrests once the bucket is removed, and wheeled versions double as a shower chair. Choose a frame with armrests for pushing up, non-slip feet or lockable castors, a weight limit above the user’s weight and a bucket with a tight lid. Empty and disinfect the bucket after each use and keep the chair beside the bed rather than in a corridor. Height-adjustable aluminium frames resist rust in humid Dar es Salaam bathrooms. Afya stocks fixed, wheeled and height-adjustable models because a commode is one of the first items families need when caring for someone at home.","Choo cha kiti ni kiti imara chenye kikalio chenye kifuniko na ndoo inayoondolewa, huwekwa kando ya kitanda ili mtu dhaifu ajisaidie bila kutembea hadi bafuni, wakati ambapo kuanguka kwingi kwa usiku hutokea. Aina nyingi pia huwekwa juu ya choo cha kawaida kama kikalio kilichoinuliwa chenye vishikio ndoo ikiondolewa, na zenye magurudumu hutumika pia kama kiti cha kuogea. Chagua fremu yenye vishikio vya mikono vya kujisukuma juu, nyayo zisizoteleza au magurudumu yanayofungwa, kiwango cha uzito kinachozidi uzito wa mtumiaji na ndoo yenye kifuniko kinachobana. Mwaga na safisha ndoo kwa dawa baada ya kila matumizi na weka kiti kando ya kitanda badala ya ukumbini. Fremu za alumini zinazorekebishwa urefu hazishiki kutu katika mabafu yenye unyevu ya Dar es Salaam. Afya inauza aina zisizohamishika, zenye magurudumu na zinazorekebishwa urefu kwa sababu choo cha kiti ni mojawapo ya vitu vya kwanza familia huhitaji zinapomuuguza mtu nyumbani."],["Essential home-care item with repeat sales of liners and disinfectant; mid-range price","Kifaa muhimu cha uuguzi wa nyumbani kinachoongeza mauzo ya mifuko na dawa za kusafisha; bei ya kati"]],"mr_knee_sleeve":[["A knee sleeve gives gentle compression and warmth that reduces swelling and makes the joint feel more secure; it does not stop the knee from bending and does not replace a brace for an unstable joint. Elasticated sleeves are thin and cool for daily wear, while neoprene holds more heat and suits evening pain or cool mornings. Measure the leg circumference about 10 cm above the kneecap and choose the matching size; a sleeve that leaves a deep mark or numbness is too tight. Wear it during activity and remove it at night, and wash it by hand to keep the elastic working. NICE guidance for osteoarthritis puts exercise and weight control first, with supports as an aid to staying active. Afya stocks several sizes because knee pain is the most common joint complaint in adults over 45.","Kishikizo cha goti hutoa mgandamizo mdogo na joto vinavyopunguza uvimbe na kufanya kiungo kihisi kuwa imara zaidi; hakizuii goti kukunjika na hakichukui nafasi ya brace kwa kiungo kisicho imara. Vishikizo vya elastiki ni vyembamba na baridi kwa matumizi ya kila siku, wakati vya neoprini hushika joto zaidi na vinafaa maumivu ya jioni au asubuhi zenye baridi. Pima mzunguko wa mguu takriban sentimita 10 juu ya kifuniko cha goti na uchague saizi inayolingana; kishikizo kinachoacha alama nzito au ganzi ni kibana mno. Kivae wakati wa shughuli na ukivue usiku, na kifue kwa mkono ili elastiki iendelee kufanya kazi. Mwongozo wa NICE wa baridi yabisi unaweka mazoezi na udhibiti wa uzito mbele, na vishikizo kama msaada wa kuendelea kuwa hai. Afya inauza saizi kadhaa kwa sababu maumivu ya goti ndiyo malalamiko ya kawaida zaidi ya viungo kwa watu wazima wenye umri zaidi ya miaka 45."],["Fast-moving, low-ticket entry product that brings joint-pain shoppers into the zone","Bidhaa ya kuingilia inayouzika haraka kwa bei ndogo, ikiwaleta wenye maumivu ya viungo kwenye eneo hili"]],"mr_knee_brace":[["A stabilised knee brace has flexible side stays that resist sideways wobble, while a hinged brace has metal hinges on both sides that guide the knee through a normal arc and protect healing ligaments. They are used after a twisting sports injury, for knees that give way on stairs, and by people with moderate arthritis who want to keep walking. Fit is critical: the hinge must sit level with the centre of the knee, and the straps should be snug but allow two fingers underneath. A suspected ligament tear, locking or a knee that cannot take weight needs medical review before bracing. Remove the brace to check the skin daily and avoid sleeping in it unless advised. Afya offers a stabiliser and a hinged option so the customer can match support level to the problem.","Brace ya goti yenye vishikizo ina vipande vinavyopinda pembeni vinavyozuia goti kuyumba upande, wakati brace yenye bawaba ina bawaba za chuma pande zote mbili zinazoongoza goti katika mwendo wa kawaida na kulinda kano zinazopona. Hutumiwa baada ya jeraha la kujipinda michezoni, kwa magoti yanayolegea ngazini, na na watu wenye baridi yabisi ya wastani wanaotaka kuendelea kutembea. Kuvaa ipasavyo ni muhimu: bawaba ikae sawa na katikati ya goti, na mikanda ibane lakini iruhusu vidole viwili chini yake. Kushukiwa kuchanika kwa kano, goti kujifunga au goti lisiloweza kubeba uzito kunahitaji uchunguzi wa daktari kabla ya kuvaa brace. Vua brace kukagua ngozi kila siku na usilale nayo isipokuwa umeshauriwa. Afya inatoa aina yenye vishikizo na yenye bawaba ili mteja alinganishe kiwango cha msaada na tatizo."],["Mid-to-high price with clear sports and arthritis demand; staff advice adds value over online sellers","Bei ya kati hadi juu yenye mahitaji ya wazi ya michezo na baridi yabisi; ushauri wa wafanyakazi huongeza thamani kuliko wauzaji wa mtandaoni"]],"mr_knee_patella":[["A patella strap is a narrow band worn just below the kneecap that presses on the patellar tendon and changes how force passes through it, easing the pain of jumper’s knee and Osgood–Schlatter disease in teenagers. A patella support with a silicone ring instead holds the kneecap centred and suits pain around the front of the knee. Both are worn only during activity and should feel firm, not numbing. Choose a universal adjustable strap for teenagers and adults, and pair it with stretching of the thigh muscles, which addresses the cause. Persistent swelling or pain at rest needs a clinician. Afya stocks these because school and street football create steady demand and the item is an easy add-on to a knee sleeve sale.","Mkanda wa kifuniko cha goti ni ukanda mwembamba unaovaliwa chini kidogo ya kifuniko cha goti unaobana kano ya goti na kubadilisha jinsi nguvu inavyopita ndani yake, ukipunguza maumivu ya goti la warukaji na ugonjwa wa Osgood–Schlatter kwa vijana. Kishikizo cha kifuniko cha goti chenye pete ya silikoni badala yake hushikilia kifuniko cha goti katikati na kinafaa maumivu ya mbele ya goti. Vyote huvaliwa wakati wa shughuli tu na vihisi kubana, si kuleta ganzi. Chagua mkanda unaorekebishwa kwa vijana na watu wazima, na uuambatanishe na mazoezi ya kunyoosha misuli ya paja, ambayo hushughulikia chanzo. Uvimbe unaoendelea au maumivu wakati wa kupumzika yanahitaji mtaalamu wa afya. Afya inauza hivi kwa sababu mpira wa shuleni na wa mtaani huleta mahitaji ya kudumu na ni nyongeza rahisi kwenye mauzo ya kishikizo cha goti."],["Cheap, compact add-on with steady sports demand from students and young adults","Nyongeza ndogo ya bei nafuu yenye mahitaji ya kudumu ya michezo kutoka kwa wanafunzi na vijana"]],"mr_knee_immob":[["A knee immobiliser is a long padded fabric splint with rigid stays that holds the leg straight, used after kneecap dislocation, some fractures, tendon repairs and knee surgery, often as a removable alternative to a plaster cast. It is chosen by length (around 35 cm for shorter legs up to 55 cm) and thigh circumference; the stays should run along the back and sides of the leg and the straps should be secure without cutting in. It is worn as directed by the doctor, usually day and night at first, and the user walks with crutches. Check the skin for pressure areas every day and watch for calf pain or swelling, which can be a sign of a clot. Afya stocks several lengths because the immobiliser is usually needed urgently, on the day of injury or discharge.","Kizuizi cha mwendo wa goti ni banzi refu la kitambaa lenye mto na vipande vigumu vinavyoshikilia mguu nyoofu, hutumiwa baada ya kifuniko cha goti kuteguka, baadhi ya mivunjiko, kurekebishwa kwa kano na upasuaji wa goti, mara nyingi kama mbadala unaoondolewa wa plasta ngumu. Huchaguliwa kwa urefu (takriban sentimita 35 kwa miguu mifupi hadi sentimita 55) na mzunguko wa paja; vipande vigumu vipite nyuma na pembeni mwa mguu na mikanda ibane bila kukata ngozi. Huvaliwa kama daktari alivyoelekeza, kwa kawaida mchana na usiku mwanzoni, na mtumiaji hutembea kwa magongo. Kagua ngozi kila siku kuona sehemu zenye mgandamizo na angalia maumivu au uvimbe wa ndama, ambao unaweza kuwa dalili ya damu kuganda. Afya inauza urefu kadhaa kwa sababu kizuizi hiki kwa kawaida huhitajika kwa dharura, siku ya jeraha au ya kuruhusiwa hospitalini."],["Urgent post-injury need that pairs with crutches for a high basket value","Hitaji la dharura baada ya jeraha linaloambatana na magongo, likiongeza thamani ya kikapu"]],"mr_ank_sleeve":[["An ankle sleeve gives compression that controls swelling after a sprain and improves the sense of joint position, which helps prevent the ankle rolling again. It is worn inside a normal shoe during the day once the first painful days have passed; for the first 48 hours rest, ice, compression and elevation matter most. Elasticated sleeves are thin enough for most shoes, while neoprene wraps with a figure-of-eight strap give firmer support for sport. Measure around the ankle and the arch to choose the size and avoid a sleeve so tight that the toes tingle. Ankle sprains are among the commonest injuries on uneven roads and football pitches, and people who have sprained once are likely to sprain again. Afya stocks several sizes and both materials as a high-volume, low-cost support.","Kishikizo cha kifundo cha mguu hutoa mgandamizo unaodhibiti uvimbe baada ya kuteguka na huboresha hisia ya mahali kiungo kilipo, jambo linalosaidia kuzuia kifundo kujipinda tena. Huvaliwa ndani ya kiatu cha kawaida mchana baada ya siku za kwanza za maumivu makali kupita; kwa saa 48 za kwanza kupumzika, barafu, mgandamizo na kuinua mguu ndivyo muhimu zaidi. Vishikizo vya elastiki ni vyembamba vya kutosha kwa viatu vingi, wakati vya neoprini vyenye mkanda wa umbo la nane hutoa msaada imara zaidi kwa michezo. Pima kuzunguka kifundo na upinde wa unyayo kuchagua saizi na epuka kishikizo kinachobana mno hadi vidole kuwasha. Kuteguka kifundo ni mojawapo ya majeraha ya kawaida zaidi kwenye barabara zisizo sawa na viwanja vya mpira, na aliyeteguka mara moja ana uwezekano wa kuteguka tena. Afya inauza saizi kadhaa na aina zote mbili kama kishikizo cha mauzo mengi na bei ndogo."],["High-volume, low-cost injury item that brings repeat sports customers","Bidhaa ya majeraha ya mauzo mengi na bei ndogo inayoleta wateja wa michezo wanaorudi"]],"mr_ank_brace":[["A lace-up ankle brace has stays or straps that limit the rolling-in movement that causes most sprains, and is the usual choice for returning to sport. A stirrup brace has two rigid shells lined with air or gel cushions on each side of the ankle; it allows walking while blocking side-to-side movement and is often used straight after a moderate sprain or a stable ankle fracture, as advised by a clinician. Both fit inside a lace-up shoe, and the shoe size usually decides the brace size. Signs that need an X-ray first include being unable to take four steps, or tenderness on the bony points of the ankle. Wear the brace for sport for several months after a sprain, because ligaments take time to regain strength. Afya stocks value and premium options so an athlete and a recovering older adult can each find the right level.","Brace ya kifundo cha mguu ya kufunga kamba ina vipande au mikanda vinavyozuia mwendo wa kujipinda kwa ndani unaosababisha miteguko mingi, na ndiyo chaguo la kawaida la kurudi michezoni. Brace ya stirapu ina magamba mawili magumu yaliyowekwa mito ya hewa au jeli pande zote za kifundo; inaruhusu kutembea huku ikizuia mwendo wa upande kwa upande na mara nyingi hutumiwa mara baada ya mteguko wa wastani au kuvunjika kifundo kusikohama, kama mtaalamu wa afya alivyoshauri. Zote huingia ndani ya kiatu cha kamba, na saizi ya kiatu kwa kawaida huamua saizi ya brace. Dalili zinazohitaji X-ray kwanza ni pamoja na kushindwa kupiga hatua nne, au maumivu ukibonyeza mifupa ya kifundo. Vaa brace michezoni kwa miezi kadhaa baada ya kuteguka, kwa sababu kano huchukua muda kurudisha nguvu. Afya inauza aina za bei nafuu na za hadhi ya juu ili mwanamichezo na mzee anayepona kila mmoja apate kiwango sahihi."],["Higher-value upgrade from the ankle sleeve with strong sports and clinic referral demand","Hatua ya juu ya thamani kutoka kishikizo cha kifundo yenye mahitaji makubwa ya michezo na rufaa za kliniki"]],"mr_ank_boot":[["A walker boot is a rigid, rocker-soled boot with straps and often air cells that holds the ankle and foot still while letting the person walk; many clinics now use it instead of a plaster cast because it can be removed for washing and skin checks. An ankle–foot orthosis (AFO) is a lighter plastic splint worn inside a shoe that holds the foot up for people with foot drop after stroke or nerve injury, preventing trips. Both should be chosen on the advice of a doctor or physiotherapist, sized by shoe size and leg height, and worn with a sock. Check the skin daily, especially over the heel and ankle bones, and wear a shoe of similar height on the other foot to avoid hip and back strain. Afya stocks a boot and an AFO because they are specialist items that are hard to find outside large hospitals.","Buti ya kutembelea ni buti ngumu yenye soli iliyopinda, mikanda na mara nyingi mifuko ya hewa inayoshikilia kifundo na unyayo vitulie huku ikimruhusu mtu kutembea; kliniki nyingi sasa huitumia badala ya plasta ngumu kwa sababu inaweza kuvuliwa kwa ajili ya kuoga na kukagua ngozi. Kishikizo cha kifundo na unyayo (AFO) ni banzi jepesi la plastiki linalovaliwa ndani ya kiatu kinachoinua unyayo kwa watu wenye unyayo unaolegea baada ya kiharusi au jeraha la mshipa wa fahamu, kikizuia kujikwaa. Vyote vichaguliwe kwa ushauri wa daktari au mtaalamu wa tiba ya viungo, saizi ikitokana na saizi ya kiatu na urefu wa mguu, na vivaliwe pamoja na soksi. Kagua ngozi kila siku, hasa juu ya kisigino na mifupa ya kifundo, na vaa kiatu chenye urefu unaolingana kwenye mguu mwingine kuepuka maumivu ya nyonga na mgongo. Afya inauza buti na AFO kwa sababu ni bidhaa za kitaalamu zinazopatikana kwa shida nje ya hospitali kubwa."],["Specialist, high-value items with little local competition and strong clinic referrals","Bidhaa za kitaalamu za thamani kubwa zenye ushindani mdogo hapa nchini na rufaa nyingi za kliniki"]],"mr_foot_heel":[["Plantar fasciitis causes sharp heel pain that is worst on the first steps after waking or after sitting, and it is common in people who stand all day, are overweight or walk barefoot on hard floors. A silicone heel cup cushions and cups the heel fat pad, absorbing shock with every step, while a plantar fascia sleeve gently compresses the arch and heel. Choose the heel cup by shoe size and use one in each shoe so the legs stay level. Combine them with calf and arch stretches, supportive shoes rather than flat sandals, and weight management; most cases improve within months. Pain with numbness, or after an injury, needs a clinician. Afya stocks these because heel pain is very common among traders, teachers and nurses and responds well to simple supports.","Plantar fasciitis husababisha maumivu makali ya kisigino yanayozidi hatua za kwanza baada ya kuamka au baada ya kuketi, na ni ya kawaida kwa wanaosimama siku nzima, wenye uzito mkubwa au wanaotembea peku kwenye sakafu ngumu. Kikombe cha silikoni cha kisigino hupunguza mshtuko na kukusanya mafuta ya kisigino kila hatua, wakati kishikizo cha plantar fascia hubana upinde wa unyayo na kisigino kwa upole. Chagua kikombe cha kisigino kulingana na saizi ya kiatu na tumia kimoja katika kila kiatu ili miguu ibaki sawa. Viambatanishe na mazoezi ya kunyoosha ndama na upinde wa unyayo, viatu vinavyoshikilia badala ya sandali bapa, na udhibiti wa uzito; hali nyingi hupona ndani ya miezi. Maumivu yenye ganzi, au baada ya jeraha, yanahitaji mtaalamu wa afya. Afya inauza hivi kwa sababu maumivu ya kisigino ni ya kawaida sana kwa wafanyabiashara, walimu na wauguzi na hupona vizuri kwa msaada rahisi."],["Common complaint with an easy, affordable fix and repeat purchase as cushions wear","Malalamiko ya kawaida yenye suluhisho rahisi na nafuu, na ununuzi wa kurudia mito inapochakaa"]],"mr_foot_insole":[["Insoles replace the thin lining of a shoe with a cushioned or contoured layer that absorbs impact and supports the arch. Foam insoles are cheap and cut to size for comfort; shock-absorbing insoles add a gel heel and forefoot pad; full silicone insoles give the most cushioning and suit people who stand all day or have arthritic knees. Choose the size by shoe size, trim along the guide lines, and make sure the shoe still has room for the toes. Replace insoles every six to twelve months, when the cushioning flattens. People with diabetes, numbness or foot ulcers need specialist footwear advice before using insoles. Afya stocks a value, mid and premium insole because comfortable feet keep people walking, which is the foundation of recovery.","Soli za ndani hubadilisha utando mwembamba wa kiatu kwa tabaka lenye mto au umbo linalopunguza mshtuko na kushikilia upinde wa unyayo. Soli za sponji ni nafuu na hukatwa kwa saizi kwa ajili ya starehe; soli za kupunguza mshtuko huongeza mto wa jeli kwenye kisigino na sehemu ya mbele ya unyayo; soli kamili za silikoni hutoa mto mwingi zaidi na zinafaa wanaosimama siku nzima au wenye baridi yabisi ya magoti. Chagua saizi kwa saizi ya kiatu, kata kufuata mistari elekezi, na hakikisha kiatu bado kina nafasi ya vidole. Badilisha soli kila miezi sita hadi kumi na miwili, mto unapobapa. Watu wenye kisukari, ganzi au vidonda vya miguu wanahitaji ushauri wa kitaalamu wa viatu kabla ya kutumia soli. Afya inauza soli za bei nafuu, kati na hadhi ya juu kwa sababu miguu yenye starehe humfanya mtu aendelee kutembea, ambao ndio msingi wa kupona."],["Everyday comfort product with broad appeal beyond patients and regular replacement","Bidhaa ya starehe ya kila siku inayowavutia wengi zaidi ya wagonjwa, ikinunuliwa tena mara kwa mara"]],"mr_wr_sup":[["A wrist support is an elastic or neoprene wrap that compresses and warms the wrist, easing pain from a mild sprain or overuse while leaving the fingers and thumb free to work. It suits people who type, wash clothes by hand, cook in volume, ride boda-boda or lift at work, and athletes returning after a minor injury. Elasticated sleeves are slim and cool; neoprene wraps with a strap can be tightened for more support. Fit it snug but never so tight that the fingers turn pale or tingle, and remove it at rest. Wrist pain after a fall, especially with swelling over the thumb side, should be X-rayed, because scaphoid fractures are easily missed. Afya stocks several sizes because wrist strain is common and a support is an easy, affordable first step.","Kishikizo cha kiwiko cha mkono ni kifungo cha elastiki au neoprini kinachobana na kupasha joto kiwiko, kikipunguza maumivu ya mteguko mdogo au matumizi kupita kiasi huku vidole na kidole gumba vikiwa huru kufanya kazi. Kinafaa wanaoandika kwenye kompyuta, wanaofua nguo kwa mkono, wanaopika kwa wingi, waendesha bodaboda au wanaobeba mizigo kazini, na wanamichezo wanaorudi baada ya jeraha dogo. Vishikizo vya elastiki ni vyembamba na baridi; vya neoprini vyenye mkanda vinaweza kukazwa kwa msaada zaidi. Kivae kikibana lakini kamwe si kiasi kwamba vidole vinapauka au kuwasha, na kivue wakati wa kupumzika. Maumivu ya kiwiko cha mkono baada ya kuanguka, hasa yenye uvimbe upande wa kidole gumba, yapigwe X-ray, kwa sababu kuvunjika kwa mfupa wa scaphoid hukoswa kwa urahisi. Afya inauza saizi kadhaa kwa sababu mshtuko wa kiwiko cha mkono ni wa kawaida na kishikizo ni hatua ya kwanza rahisi na nafuu."],["Low-cost, fast-moving support with broad appeal to workers and athletes","Kishikizo cha bei ndogo kinachouzika haraka chenye mvuto mpana kwa wafanyakazi na wanamichezo"]],"mr_wr_splint":[["A wrist splint has a metal or plastic stay along the palm side that holds the wrist straight while the fingers stay free. It is the first treatment for carpal tunnel syndrome, which causes tingling and numbness in the thumb and fingers, often at night and in pregnancy; wearing the splint at night keeps the nerve from being squeezed. It is also used for wrist sprains and for support in the weeks after a forearm cast comes off. Splints come in left and right versions and by wrist size, so check both before buying, and make sure the stay can be bent slightly to fit. Weakness of the thumb muscles or constant numbness needs medical assessment. Afya stocks value and branded splints because carpal tunnel is common in women, people with diabetes and manual workers.","Banzi la kiwiko cha mkono lina kipande cha chuma au plastiki upande wa kiganja kinachoshikilia kiwiko nyoofu huku vidole vikibaki huru. Ni tiba ya kwanza ya ugonjwa wa carpal tunnel, unaosababisha kuwashwa na ganzi kwenye kidole gumba na vidole, mara nyingi usiku na wakati wa ujauzito; kuvaa banzi usiku huzuia mshipa wa fahamu kubanwa. Pia hutumiwa kwa miteguko ya kiwiko cha mkono na kwa msaada katika wiki za baada ya plasta ngumu ya mkono kuondolewa. Banzi huja kwa mkono wa kushoto na kulia na kwa saizi ya kiwiko, hivyo kagua vyote kabla ya kununua, na hakikisha kipande kigumu kinaweza kupindwa kidogo ili kitoshee. Udhaifu wa misuli ya kidole gumba au ganzi ya kudumu unahitaji uchunguzi wa daktari. Afya inauza banzi za bei nafuu na za chapa kwa sababu carpal tunnel ni ya kawaida kwa wanawake, watu wenye kisukari na wafanyakazi wa mikono."],["Clear clinical use with returning demand from pregnancy and diabetes customers","Matumizi ya wazi ya kitabibu yenye mahitaji yanayorudi kutoka kwa wajawazito na wenye kisukari"]],"mr_thumb":[["A thumb brace (thumb spica) wraps the wrist and thumb with stays that keep the thumb still while the other fingers move freely. It relieves De Quervain’s tenosynovitis, a painful strain of the thumb tendons common in new mothers who lift babies and in people who wring clothes or text heavily, and it protects a sprained thumb after a fall. It also eases arthritis at the base of the thumb during tasks such as opening jars. Choose a universal brace that fits either hand and adjust the straps so the thumb sits in a comfortable, slightly open position. Wear it for activities and at night during flare-ups, and see a clinician if pain lasts more than a few weeks. Afya stocks it because it fills a gap that wrist supports cannot.","Brace ya kidole gumba hufunga kiwiko cha mkono na kidole gumba kwa vipande vigumu vinavyoweka kidole gumba kitulie huku vidole vingine vikitembea huru. Huondoa maumivu ya De Quervain, mshtuko unaouma wa kano za kidole gumba unaowapata mara nyingi mama wapya wanaowabeba watoto na watu wanaokamua nguo au kuandika ujumbe kwa wingi, na hulinda kidole gumba kilichoteguka baada ya kuanguka. Pia hupunguza baridi yabisi kwenye shina la kidole gumba wakati wa kazi kama kufungua chupa. Chagua brace inayofaa mkono wowote na urekebishe mikanda ili kidole gumba kikae kwenye mkao wa starehe, ulio wazi kidogo. Ivae wakati wa shughuli na usiku maumivu yanapozidi, na umwone mtaalamu wa afya ikiwa maumivu yanadumu zaidi ya wiki chache. Afya inaiuza kwa sababu inajaza pengo ambalo vishikizo vya kiwiko haviwezi."],["Specific, well-understood problem with little local supply; useful cross-sell to mothers","Tatizo maalum linaloeleweka vizuri lenye upatikanaji mdogo hapa nchini; nyongeza nzuri ya mauzo kwa akina mama"]],"mr_elbow":[["Tennis elbow causes pain on the outer elbow from repeated gripping and twisting, and is common in mechanics, carpenters, cooks and people who carry heavy bags, not only in tennis players. A forearm strap worn just below the elbow spreads the pulling force on the tendon and eases pain during work, while an elastic or neoprene elbow sleeve gives compression and warmth for general strain and swelling. Fit the strap two finger-widths below the painful point and tighten it only enough to feel firm. Combine it with rest from the aggravating task and gradual strengthening exercises, which are the main treatment; most cases settle within a year. A swollen, red, hot elbow or one that cannot straighten after a fall needs medical review. Afya stocks a value sleeve, a neoprene sleeve and a strap to match each need.","Tennis elbow husababisha maumivu upande wa nje wa kiwiko kutokana na kushika na kupinda mara kwa mara, na ni ya kawaida kwa mafundi magari, maseremala, wapishi na wanaobeba mifuko mizito, si kwa wachezaji tenisi tu. Mkanda wa mkono wa mbele unaovaliwa chini kidogo ya kiwiko hutawanya nguvu ya kuvuta kwenye kano na kupunguza maumivu wakati wa kazi, wakati kishikizo cha kiwiko cha elastiki au neoprini hutoa mgandamizo na joto kwa mshtuko wa jumla na uvimbe. Weka mkanda upana wa vidole viwili chini ya sehemu inayouma na ukaze kiasi cha kuhisi kubana tu. Uambatanishe na kupumzika kutoka kazi inayochochea maumivu na mazoezi ya kuongeza nguvu taratibu, ambayo ndiyo tiba kuu; hali nyingi hutulia ndani ya mwaka mmoja. Kiwiko kilichovimba, chekundu na cha moto au kisichoweza kunyooka baada ya kuanguka kinahitaji uchunguzi wa daktari. Afya inauza kishikizo cha bei nafuu, cha neoprini na mkanda ili kukidhi kila hitaji."],["Inexpensive supports for a common work-related complaint, often bought in pairs with wrist supports","Vishikizo nafuu kwa malalamiko ya kawaida yanayotokana na kazi, mara nyingi hununuliwa pamoja na vishikizo vya kiwiko cha mkono"]],"mr_sh_sup":[["A shoulder support is a neoprene or fabric wrap that covers the shoulder joint and fastens under the opposite armpit, giving warmth, compression and a sense of security during movement. It helps people with rotator-cuff strain, shoulder arthritis and those whose shoulder has dislocated before and feels unstable during work or sport. A braced model with stays limits extreme movement more firmly. It is not a substitute for a sling after a fracture or dislocation, and a shoulder that suddenly cannot lift, or pain after a fall, needs medical review. Wear the support during activity, alongside gentle exercises prescribed by a physiotherapist, because stiffness is the main risk of resting a shoulder too long. Afya stocks a universal neoprene support and a braced option.","Kishikizo cha bega ni kifungo cha neoprini au kitambaa kinachofunika kiungo cha bega na kufungwa chini ya kwapa la upande mwingine, kikitoa joto, mgandamizo na hisia ya usalama wakati wa kutembea mkono. Huwasaidia watu wenye mshtuko wa rotator cuff, baridi yabisi ya bega na wale ambao bega lao liliwahi kuteguka na huhisi si imara wakati wa kazi au michezo. Aina yenye vipande vigumu huzuia mwendo uliokithiri kwa uthabiti zaidi. Si mbadala wa kombeo baada ya kuvunjika au kuteguka, na bega linaloshindwa ghafla kuinuka, au maumivu baada ya kuanguka, yanahitaji uchunguzi wa daktari. Vaa kishikizo wakati wa shughuli, pamoja na mazoezi mepesi yaliyoelekezwa na mtaalamu wa tiba ya viungo, kwa sababu kukakamaa ndiyo hatari kuu ya kupumzisha bega muda mrefu mno. Afya inauza kishikizo cha neoprini kinachofaa wote na aina yenye vipande vigumu."],["Fills a gap between slings and back supports; mid-price with good margin","Hujaza pengo kati ya kombeo na vishikizo vya mgongo; bei ya kati yenye faida nzuri"]],"mr_sh_imm":[["A shoulder immobiliser holds the arm against the body with a sling and a waist strap, keeping the shoulder still in the first weeks after dislocation, fracture of the upper arm or collarbone, or shoulder surgery. An abduction model adds a small pillow that holds the arm slightly away from the body, which surgeons often request after rotator-cuff repair. Fit is set by the doctor or physiotherapist: the elbow should sit fully in the sling at a right angle and the wrist should not hang lower than the elbow. The user should still move the fingers, wrist and elbow as instructed to prevent stiffness and swelling. Most immobilisers are worn day and night for two to six weeks. Afya stocks a universal immobiliser and a premium abduction sling because they are needed promptly after discharge.","Kizuizi cha mwendo wa bega hushikilia mkono kando ya mwili kwa kombeo na mkanda wa kiuno, kikiweka bega litulie katika wiki za kwanza baada ya kuteguka, kuvunjika mfupa wa juu wa mkono au mfupa wa bega, au upasuaji wa bega. Aina ya abduction huongeza mto mdogo unaoshikilia mkono mbali kidogo na mwili, ambao madaktari wa upasuaji mara nyingi huuhitaji baada ya kurekebisha rotator cuff. Kuvaa hurekebishwa na daktari au mtaalamu wa tiba ya viungo: kiwiko kikae kikamilifu ndani ya kombeo kwa pembe mraba na kifundo cha mkono kisining’inie chini kuliko kiwiko. Mtumiaji bado anapaswa kutembeza vidole, kifundo cha mkono na kiwiko kama alivyoelekezwa ili kuzuia kukakamaa na uvimbe. Vizuizi vingi huvaliwa mchana na usiku kwa wiki mbili hadi sita. Afya inauza kizuizi kinachofaa wote na kombeo la abduction la hadhi ya juu kwa sababu huhitajika haraka baada ya kuruhusiwa hospitalini."],["Urgent, prescription-driven purchase with a high-value premium option","Ununuzi wa dharura unaoongozwa na maelekezo ya daktari, wenye chaguo la hadhi ya juu la thamani kubwa"]],"mr_sling":[["An arm sling supports the weight of the forearm so that an injured wrist, forearm, elbow or shoulder can rest and swelling settles. A pouch sling is a fabric cradle with a padded neck strap and is the comfortable choice for weeks of wear; a foam sling is light and cool; a triangular bandage is the classic first-aid sling that also works as a pad or bandage in emergencies. The hand should sit slightly higher than the elbow to reduce swelling, and the strap should be padded where it crosses the neck. Children need a junior size so the arm is not left hanging. Keep the fingers moving several times a day. Afya stocks junior and adult pouches, a low-cost sling and triangular bandages because every arm injury needs one and they belong in every home first-aid kit.","Kombeo la mkono hubeba uzito wa mkono wa mbele ili kiwiko cha mkono, mkono wa mbele, kiwiko au bega lililojeruhiwa vipumzike na uvimbe upungue. Kombeo la mfuko ni tandiko la kitambaa lenye mkanda wa shingo wenye mto na ndilo chaguo la starehe kwa kuvaa wiki kadhaa; kombeo la sponji ni jepesi na baridi; bendeji ya pembetatu ni kombeo la jadi la huduma ya kwanza ambalo pia hutumika kama pedi au bendeji wakati wa dharura. Kiganja kikae juu kidogo ya kiwiko ili kupunguza uvimbe, na mkanda uwe na mto mahali unapovuka shingo. Watoto wanahitaji saizi ya watoto ili mkono usibaki ukining’inia. Endelea kutembeza vidole mara kadhaa kwa siku. Afya inauza mifuko ya watoto na ya watu wazima, kombeo la bei ndogo na bendeji za pembetatu kwa sababu kila jeraha la mkono linahitaji moja na zinastahili kuwa katika kila kifaa cha huduma ya kwanza ya nyumbani."],["Universal injury item at every price point; doubles as a first-aid kit staple","Bidhaa ya majeraha inayofaa kila bei; pia ni muhimu katika kifaa cha huduma ya kwanza"]],"mr_back_el":[["An elastic back support wraps the lower back and abdomen, giving compression and warmth that ease muscle spasm and remind the wearer to bend with the knees. It is used for flare-ups of low-back pain, by market porters, drivers and nurses during heavy work, and for the first weeks back at work after a strain. Fit it around the waist at belly-button level, tight enough to feel supported while still breathing comfortably. Wear it during activity rather than all day, because long-term constant use can weaken the core muscles; staying active and exercising are the main treatment for most back pain. Back pain with leg weakness, numbness around the bottom, loss of bladder control or fever needs urgent medical attention. Afya stocks a neoprene, a branded advanced and a sacro-lumbar elastic model.","Kishikizo cha mgongo cha elastiki hufunga mgongo wa chini na tumbo, kikitoa mgandamizo na joto vinavyopunguza mkazo wa misuli na kumkumbusha mvaaji kuinama kwa magoti. Hutumiwa maumivu ya mgongo wa chini yanapozidi, na wabeba mizigo sokoni, madereva na wauguzi wakati wa kazi nzito, na katika wiki za kwanza za kurudi kazini baada ya mshtuko. Kifunge kiunoni usawa wa kitovu, kikibana kiasi cha kuhisi kushikiliwa huku ukipumua kwa starehe. Kivae wakati wa shughuli badala ya siku nzima, kwa sababu kukitumia kila wakati kwa muda mrefu kunaweza kudhoofisha misuli ya kiini; kuendelea kuwa hai na kufanya mazoezi ndiyo tiba kuu ya maumivu mengi ya mgongo. Maumivu ya mgongo yenye udhaifu wa miguu, ganzi kuzunguka makalio, kushindwa kuzuia mkojo au homa yanahitaji huduma ya haraka ya daktari. Afya inauza aina ya neoprini, ya chapa ya hali ya juu na ya elastiki ya sacro-lumbar."],["Back pain is the commonest musculoskeletal complaint; steady sales across all price levels","Maumivu ya mgongo ndiyo malalamiko ya kawaida zaidi ya misuli na mifupa; mauzo ya kudumu katika bei zote"]],"mr_back_ls":[["A lumbo-sacral (LS) belt is a firmer back support with vertical stays at the back that limit bending and twisting, used for disc prolapse, sciatica, spondylosis and in the weeks after some back injuries when a doctor wants movement reduced. It is sized by waist circumference in inches, so measure around the belly button before choosing small, medium, large or XL. The stays should lie along the spine and the belt should not ride up under the ribs. Use it for activities such as travel on rough roads, lifting or long hours of standing, and follow the doctor’s advice on how many weeks to wear it. Sudden leg weakness or bladder problems with back pain are an emergency. Afya stocks three designs at different price levels because LS belts are among the most prescribed supports in Tanzanian orthopaedic clinics.","Mkanda wa lumbo-sacral (LS) ni kishikizo imara zaidi cha mgongo chenye vipande vigumu vilivyo wima nyuma vinavyozuia kuinama na kujipinda, hutumiwa kwa diski iliyohama, sciatica, spondylosis na katika wiki za baada ya baadhi ya majeraha ya mgongo daktari anapotaka mwendo upunguzwe. Huchaguliwa kwa mzunguko wa kiuno kwa inchi, hivyo pima kuzunguka kitovu kabla ya kuchagua ndogo, ya kati, kubwa au XL. Vipande vigumu vilale kando ya uti wa mgongo na mkanda usipande hadi chini ya mbavu. Utumie wakati wa shughuli kama kusafiri kwenye barabara mbovu, kubeba mizigo au kusimama kwa saa nyingi, na fuata ushauri wa daktari kuhusu wiki ngapi za kuuvaa. Udhaifu wa ghafla wa miguu au matatizo ya kibofu pamoja na maumivu ya mgongo ni dharura. Afya inauza miundo mitatu kwa bei tofauti kwa sababu mikanda ya LS ni miongoni mwa vishikizo vinavyoandikwa zaidi katika kliniki za mifupa Tanzania."],["Prescription-driven support with predictable demand and sizes that reward deep stock","Kishikizo kinachoandikwa na madaktari chenye mahitaji yanayotabirika na saizi zinazohitaji akiba ya kutosha"]],"mr_posture":[["A posture corrector is a figure-of-eight strap or a braced vest that gently draws the shoulders back, reminding the wearer to sit and stand upright. It suits students, office workers and drivers whose upper back and neck ache after hours of leaning forward over screens. Wear it for short periods, starting with 20 to 30 minutes a few times a day, and pair it with chest stretches and upper-back strengthening; the aim is to train the muscles, not to rely on the strap. Straps should not cut into the armpits or cause tingling in the hands. An electronic trainer that vibrates when you slouch is an option for people who prefer not to wear a strap. Afya stocks a strap, a braced vest and an electronic trainer because posture complaints are rising among young urban customers.","Kirekebishaji cha mkao ni mkanda wa umbo la nane au fulana yenye vipande vigumu inayovuta mabega nyuma kwa upole, ikimkumbusha mvaaji kukaa na kusimama wima. Kinafaa wanafunzi, wafanyakazi wa ofisini na madereva ambao mgongo wa juu na shingo huuma baada ya saa za kuinama mbele ya skrini. Kivae kwa muda mfupi, ukianza na dakika 20 hadi 30 mara chache kwa siku, na kiambatanishe na mazoezi ya kunyoosha kifua na kuimarisha mgongo wa juu; lengo ni kufundisha misuli, si kutegemea mkanda. Mikanda isikate kwapani wala kusababisha kuwashwa mikononi. Kifaa cha kielektroniki kinachotetemeka unapoinama ni chaguo kwa wasiopenda kuvaa mkanda. Afya inauza mkanda, fulana yenye vipande vigumu na kifaa cha kielektroniki kwa sababu malalamiko ya mkao yanaongezeka miongoni mwa wateja vijana wa mjini."],["Lifestyle product with appeal to students and office workers; good online seller","Bidhaa ya mtindo wa maisha inayowavutia wanafunzi na wafanyakazi wa ofisini; huuzika vizuri mtandaoni"]],"mr_neck_soft":[["A soft cervical collar is a foam ring covered in cotton that fastens at the back of the neck, supporting the head and reminding the wearer to limit sudden movement. It is used for a few days after a neck strain or minor whiplash, during flare-ups of neck arthritis, and on long road journeys. Measure from the chin to the top of the shoulder for height and around the neck for size; the collar should hold the chin level without pushing it up. Current advice is to wear it only for short periods and keep the neck gently moving, because long-term use weakens the neck muscles. A soft collar must never be used after a serious accident where a neck fracture is possible; that needs emergency care and a rigid collar fitted by professionals. Afya stocks several sizes from value to branded.","Kola laini ya shingo ni pete ya sponji iliyofunikwa kwa pamba inayofungwa nyuma ya shingo, ikishikilia kichwa na kumkumbusha mvaaji kupunguza mwendo wa ghafla. Hutumiwa kwa siku chache baada ya mshtuko wa shingo au whiplash ndogo, wakati baridi yabisi ya shingo inapozidi, na katika safari ndefu za barabarani. Pima kutoka kidevuni hadi juu ya bega kwa urefu na kuzunguka shingo kwa saizi; kola ishikilie kidevu sawa bila kukisukuma juu. Ushauri wa sasa ni kuivaa kwa muda mfupi tu na kuendelea kutembeza shingo kwa upole, kwa sababu kuitumia muda mrefu hudhoofisha misuli ya shingo. Kola laini kamwe isitumiwe baada ya ajali mbaya ambapo shingo inaweza kuwa imevunjika; hilo linahitaji huduma ya dharura na kola ngumu inayowekwa na wataalamu. Afya inauza saizi kadhaa kuanzia za bei nafuu hadi za chapa."],["Inexpensive, frequently requested after road accidents and for long-distance travellers","Bidhaa nafuu inayoombwa mara kwa mara baada ya ajali za barabarani na kwa wasafiri wa masafa marefu"]],"mr_neck_hard":[["A rigid cervical collar is made of firm plastic or dense foam, often with a chin rest, and restricts neck movement far more than a soft collar. It is used on a doctor’s instruction after stable neck fractures, some neck operations and severe ligament injuries, usually for several weeks. Correct sizing is essential and is normally done by the clinical team: the chin must sit in the chin piece, the back panel must reach the shoulders and the collar must not press on the windpipe. Skin under the collar needs daily cleaning and checking for pressure sores, ideally with one person holding the head still while another changes the padding. Families buy these to replace a hospital collar or to have a spare for washing. Afya stocks value and chin-support models so prescriptions can be filled the same day.","Kola ngumu ya shingo hutengenezwa kwa plastiki ngumu au sponji nzito, mara nyingi ikiwa na egemeo la kidevu, na huzuia mwendo wa shingo zaidi sana kuliko kola laini. Hutumiwa kwa maelekezo ya daktari baada ya kuvunjika kwa shingo kusikohama, baadhi ya upasuaji wa shingo na majeraha makubwa ya kano, kwa kawaida kwa wiki kadhaa. Saizi sahihi ni muhimu na kwa kawaida hupimwa na timu ya matibabu: kidevu kikae kwenye kishikio cha kidevu, sehemu ya nyuma ifike mabegani na kola isibane koromeo. Ngozi chini ya kola inahitaji kusafishwa na kukaguliwa kila siku kuona vidonda vya mgandamizo, ikiwezekana mtu mmoja akishikilia kichwa kitulie huku mwingine akibadilisha mto. Familia hununua hizi kuchukua nafasi ya kola ya hospitali au kuwa na ya ziada wakati wa kufua. Afya inauza aina za bei nafuu na zenye egemeo la kidevu ili maagizo ya daktari yatimizwe siku ileile."],["Prescription-led specialist item with no substitute; small stock covers many requests","Bidhaa ya kitaalamu inayoongozwa na maagizo isiyo na mbadala; akiba ndogo hukidhi maombi mengi"]],"mr_abd_binder":[["An abdominal binder is a wide elastic panel that wraps the belly and closes with velcro, supporting the wound and muscles after abdominal surgery, caesarean section or hernia repair. It reduces pain when coughing, getting out of bed and walking, which helps people move sooner and recover faster. Choose by waist or hip circumference and a panel depth that covers the incision without rolling over it; three- or four-panel binders suit taller people. Wear it over a thin layer of clothing, take it off to check the wound and skin, and follow the surgeon’s advice on how long to use it, usually two to six weeks. A binder is not a slimming product and should not be worn so tight that breathing is restricted. Afya stocks value and premium binders because caesarean and general surgery rates are rising across Tanzania.","Mkanda wa tumbo ni kipande kipana cha elastiki kinachofunga tumbo na kufungwa kwa velcro, kikishikilia kidonda na misuli baada ya upasuaji wa tumbo, kujifungua kwa upasuaji au kurekebishwa kwa ngiri. Hupunguza maumivu wakati wa kukohoa, kutoka kitandani na kutembea, jambo linalowasaidia watu kuanza kutembea mapema na kupona haraka. Chagua kwa mzunguko wa kiuno au nyonga na upana wa kipande unaofunika kidonda bila kujikunja juu yake; mikanda ya vipande vitatu au vinne inafaa watu warefu. Uvae juu ya tabaka jembamba la nguo, uvue kukagua kidonda na ngozi, na fuata ushauri wa daktari wa upasuaji kuhusu muda wa kuutumia, kwa kawaida wiki mbili hadi sita. Mkanda huu si wa kupunguza unene na usivaliwe ukibana kiasi cha kuzuia kupumua. Afya inauza mikanda ya bei nafuu na ya hadhi ya juu kwa sababu upasuaji wa kujifungua na upasuaji wa jumla unaongezeka kote Tanzania."],["Strong post-surgery demand including caesarean mothers; natural cross-sell with dressings","Mahitaji makubwa baada ya upasuaji ikiwemo akina mama waliojifungua kwa upasuaji; huuzika pamoja na plasta za kidonda"]],"mr_hernia":[["A hernia belt (truss) is a padded belt that presses gently over a groin hernia to keep the bulge in and reduce discomfort during work and walking. It is a temporary measure for people waiting for surgery or for whom surgery is not yet possible; it does not cure a hernia, and surgery remains the definitive treatment. The hernia must be pushed back in while lying down before the belt is put on; a belt should never be fitted over a hernia that will not go back. Choose by hip size and the side of the hernia, and check the skin under the pads daily. A hernia that becomes hard, very painful, red or causes vomiting is an emergency needing immediate hospital care. Afya stocks a padded belt because inguinal hernia is very common in Tanzanian men and waiting times for surgery can be long.","Mkanda wa ngiri ni mkanda wenye mto unaobana kwa upole juu ya ngiri ya kinena ili kuzuia uvimbe kutoka na kupunguza usumbufu wakati wa kazi na kutembea. Ni hatua ya muda kwa wanaosubiri upasuaji au ambao upasuaji bado hauwezekani; hauponyi ngiri, na upasuaji ndio tiba kamili. Ngiri lazima irudishwe ndani ukiwa umelala kabla ya kuvaa mkanda; mkanda kamwe usivaliwe juu ya ngiri isiyorudi ndani. Chagua kwa saizi ya nyonga na upande wa ngiri, na kagua ngozi chini ya mito kila siku. Ngiri inayokuwa ngumu, inayouma sana, nyekundu au inayosababisha kutapika ni dharura inayohitaji huduma ya hospitali mara moja. Afya inauza mkanda wenye mto kwa sababu ngiri ya kinena ni ya kawaida sana kwa wanaume Tanzania na muda wa kusubiri upasuaji unaweza kuwa mrefu."],["Common, discreet need for men; staff guidance on safe use builds trust","Hitaji la kawaida na la siri kwa wanaume; mwongozo wa wafanyakazi kuhusu matumizi salama hujenga uaminifu"]],"mr_comp_bk":[["Graduated compression stockings are tightest at the ankle and gradually looser up the leg, helping veins push blood back to the heart. Below-knee stockings are the most used type, for tired swollen legs, mild varicose veins, standing jobs and long journeys, and are easier to put on than thigh-length ones. Measure the ankle and calf in the morning before swelling builds, and choose class 1 (light) for comfort and prevention; higher classes are for diagnosed venous disease and should be advised by a clinician. Put them on first thing in the morning, smooth out wrinkles and never roll the top down, which creates a tight band. People with poor circulation in the legs, such as some people with diabetes or peripheral arterial disease, must check with a doctor first. Afya stocks branded and value pairs because swollen legs are common in the heat and among shopkeepers, teachers and nurses.","Soksi za mgandamizo hubana zaidi kwenye kifundo cha mguu na kulegea taratibu kuelekea juu, zikisaidia mishipa ya vena kusukuma damu kurudi moyoni. Soksi za chini ya goti ndizo zinazotumiwa zaidi, kwa miguu iliyochoka na kuvimba, varikosi ndogo, kazi za kusimama na safari ndefu, na ni rahisi kuvaa kuliko za kufika pajani. Pima kifundo na ndama asubuhi kabla ya uvimbe kuongezeka, na chagua daraja la 1 (jepesi) kwa starehe na kinga; madaraja ya juu ni kwa ugonjwa wa vena uliothibitishwa na yashauriwe na mtaalamu wa afya. Zivae mara tu unapoamka, nyoosha mikunjo na kamwe usikunje sehemu ya juu chini, jambo linaloleta mkanda unaobana. Watu wenye mzunguko hafifu wa damu miguuni, kama baadhi ya wenye kisukari au ugonjwa wa mishipa ya ateri, lazima wamuulize daktari kwanza. Afya inauza jozi za chapa na za bei nafuu kwa sababu kuvimba miguu ni kawaida wakati wa joto na miongoni mwa wenye maduka, walimu na wauguzi."],["Repeat purchase every 3–6 months as elastic wears; strong appeal to standing workers","Ununuzi wa kurudia kila miezi 3–6 elastiki inapochakaa; mvuto mkubwa kwa wanaofanya kazi wakisimama"]],"mr_comp_th":[["Thigh-length graduated compression stockings extend the support above the knee, for varicose veins on the thigh, swelling of the whole leg, and after vein procedures when a doctor advises full-leg compression. They are harder to put on, so a smooth technique matters: turn the stocking inside out to the heel, slip the foot in, then ease it up the leg in stages without pulling on the top band. Silicone grip tops keep them from slipping in the heat. Measure ankle, calf and thigh in the morning and choose the class advised by the clinician; class 2 stockings need a prescription-level assessment. Replace them every three to six months and wash by hand in cool water. Afya stocks a local, a mid and a premium brand, including a TZ-available pair, because varicose veins are common in women after pregnancy.","Soksi za mgandamizo za kufika pajani huendeleza msaada juu ya goti, kwa varikosi za pajani, uvimbe wa mguu mzima, na baada ya matibabu ya mishipa daktari anaposhauri mgandamizo wa mguu mzima. Ni ngumu zaidi kuvaa, hivyo mbinu laini ni muhimu: geuza soksi ndani-nje hadi kisigino, ingiza unyayo, kisha ipandishe mguuni hatua kwa hatua bila kuvuta mkanda wa juu. Sehemu za juu zenye silikoni huzuia kuteleza wakati wa joto. Pima kifundo, ndama na paja asubuhi na uchague daraja alilolishauri mtaalamu wa afya; soksi za daraja la 2 zinahitaji tathmini ya kitaalamu. Zibadilishe kila miezi mitatu hadi sita na zifue kwa mkono kwa maji baridi. Afya inauza chapa ya hapa nchini, ya kati na ya hadhi ya juu, ikiwemo jozi inayopatikana Tanzania, kwa sababu varikosi ni za kawaida kwa wanawake baada ya ujauzito."],["Higher price than below-knee with loyal repeat buyers on clinician advice","Bei kubwa kuliko za chini ya goti, zenye wanunuzi waaminifu wanaorudi kwa ushauri wa mtaalamu"]],"mr_comp_ted":[["Anti-embolism stockings are white, lighter-pressure stockings designed for people lying in bed, not for walking, and reduce the risk of deep-vein thrombosis after surgery, during prolonged illness or after a caesarean when mobility is limited. They are different from everyday compression stockings, which are designed for people who are up and about. NICE guidance advises that they should be fitted from leg measurements, worn day and night until the person is moving normally again, and removed daily to wash and check the skin. They should not be used by people with poor arterial circulation, severe leg swelling from heart failure, or fragile skin without professional advice. Calf pain, swelling or breathlessness are warning signs that need urgent care. Afya stocks them so families can follow the discharge plan at home.","Soksi za kuzuia damu kuganda ni nyeupe zenye mgandamizo mwepesi zaidi zilizoundwa kwa watu waliolala kitandani, si kwa kutembea, na hupunguza hatari ya damu kuganda katika mishipa mirefu baada ya upasuaji, wakati wa ugonjwa wa muda mrefu au baada ya kujifungua kwa upasuaji mtu asipoweza kutembea vizuri. Ni tofauti na soksi za mgandamizo za kila siku, ambazo zimeundwa kwa watu wanaotembea. Mwongozo wa NICE unashauri zivaliwe kwa vipimo vya mguu, zivaliwe mchana na usiku hadi mtu atakapoanza kutembea kama kawaida, na zivuliwe kila siku kufuliwa na kukagua ngozi. Zisitumiwe na watu wenye mzunguko hafifu wa damu ya ateri, uvimbe mkubwa wa miguu kutokana na moyo kushindwa kufanya kazi, au ngozi dhaifu bila ushauri wa kitaalamu. Maumivu au uvimbe wa ndama au kukosa pumzi ni dalili za hatari zinazohitaji huduma ya haraka. Afya inaziuza ili familia zifuate mpango wa kuruhusiwa hospitalini zikiwa nyumbani."],["Discharge-plan item that hospitals rarely supply; low competition","Bidhaa ya mpango wa kuruhusiwa ambayo hospitali mara chache huitoa; ushindani mdogo"]],"mr_comp_travel":[["Travel compression socks look like ordinary socks but apply light graduated pressure that keeps blood moving during long periods of sitting, reducing ankle swelling and the small risk of a clot on long flights or bus journeys such as Dar to Mwanza. They suit pregnant travellers, older adults, people who have had recent surgery and anyone who arrives with swollen feet. Choose by shoe size, put them on before the journey, and combine them with walking or ankle exercises every hour and plenty of water. People with a past clot or recent major surgery should ask a doctor about extra precautions. Afya stocks a local and a branded option because travel for funerals, weddings and the December holidays is a regular part of Tanzanian life.","Soksi za mgandamizo za safari huonekana kama soksi za kawaida lakini hutoa mgandamizo mwepesi unaopungua juu unaoweka damu iendelee kutembea wakati wa kukaa kwa muda mrefu, ukipunguza uvimbe wa vifundo na hatari ndogo ya damu kuganda katika safari ndefu za ndege au basi kama Dar hadi Mwanza. Zinafaa wasafiri wajawazito, wazee, waliofanyiwa upasuaji hivi karibuni na yeyote anayefika akiwa na miguu iliyovimba. Chagua kwa saizi ya kiatu, zivae kabla ya safari, na ziambatanishe na kutembea au mazoezi ya vifundo kila saa na kunywa maji ya kutosha. Watu waliowahi kuganda damu au waliofanyiwa upasuaji mkubwa hivi karibuni wamuulize daktari kuhusu tahadhari za ziada. Afya inauza chaguo la bei nafuu na la chapa kwa sababu safari za misiba, harusi na sikukuu za Desemba ni sehemu ya kawaida ya maisha ya Watanzania."],["Seasonal travel and gift item with good margin","Bidhaa ya msimu wa safari na zawadi yenye faida nzuri"]],"mr_comp_tubular":[["Tubular elastic bandage, such as Tubigrip, is a seamless tube of cotton and elastic that slides over a limb to give even, light compression. It is used for mild sprains and strains, swollen knees and ankles, and to hold dressings or pads on a limb without tape. It comes on a roll in sizes by limb circumference, so the pharmacist cuts the length needed, usually doubled over for a firmer hold. It is easier to apply evenly than a crepe bandage, but should be removed at night unless advised otherwise, and should never cause tingling, colour change or pain. It is not a substitute for graduated stockings in venous disease. Afya stocks it as a versatile, cut-to-length item for sprains and post-operative care.","Bendeji ya elastiki ya mrija, kama Tubigrip, ni mrija usio na mshono wa pamba na elastiki unaoingizwa juu ya kiungo kutoa mgandamizo sawa na mwepesi. Hutumiwa kwa miteguko na mishtuko midogo, magoti na vifundo vilivyovimba, na kushikilia plasta au pedi kwenye kiungo bila tepu. Huja kwenye roli kwa saizi kulingana na mzunguko wa kiungo, hivyo mfamasia hukata urefu unaohitajika, kwa kawaida hukunjwa mara mbili kwa kubana zaidi. Ni rahisi kuweka sawasawa kuliko bendeji ya krepu, lakini ivuliwe usiku isipokuwa umeshauriwa vinginevyo, na kamwe isisababishe kuwashwa, kubadilika rangi au maumivu. Si mbadala wa soksi za mgandamizo kwa ugonjwa wa vena. Afya inaiuza kama bidhaa yenye matumizi mengi inayokatwa kwa urefu kwa ajili ya miteguko na utunzaji baada ya upasuaji."],["Versatile clinic-style product that differentiates the store from supermarkets","Bidhaa yenye matumizi mengi ya mtindo wa kliniki inayotofautisha duka na maduka makubwa"]],"mr_comp_crepe":[["A crepe bandage is a stretchy woven roll used to compress and support a sprained ankle, wrist or knee and to hold dressings in place. Choose the width by body part: 7.5 cm for wrists and hands, 10 cm for ankles and elbows, and 15 cm for knees and thighs. Wrap from below the injury upwards in a spiral or figure-of-eight, overlapping each turn by half, with even, moderate tension; check the toes or fingers stay warm and pink. Remove it at night and rewrap in the morning, and wash and reuse it while the elastic recovers. It belongs in every home first-aid kit and is the core of the rest, ice, compression and elevation routine for sprains. Afya stocks three widths at a low price because they are among the most frequently requested injury items.","Bendeji ya krepu ni roli iliyofumwa inayonyooka inayotumiwa kubana na kushikilia kifundo cha mguu, kiwiko cha mkono au goti lililoteguka na kushikilia plasta za kidonda. Chagua upana kulingana na sehemu ya mwili: sentimita 7.5 kwa viwiko vya mikono na viganja, sentimita 10 kwa vifundo vya miguu na viwiko, na sentimita 15 kwa magoti na mapaja. Funga kuanzia chini ya jeraha kuelekea juu kwa mzunguko au umbo la nane, kila mzunguko ukifunika nusu ya uliotangulia, kwa mkazo wa wastani na sawa; hakikisha vidole vinabaki na joto na rangi ya kawaida. Ivue usiku na uifunge tena asubuhi, na uifue na kuitumia tena elastiki inaporudi. Inastahili kuwa katika kila kifaa cha huduma ya kwanza nyumbani na ndiyo kiini cha utaratibu wa kupumzika, barafu, mgandamizo na kuinua kiungo kwa miteguko. Afya inauza upana mitatu kwa bei ndogo kwa sababu ni miongoni mwa bidhaa za majeraha zinazoombwa zaidi."],["Very low price, very high turnover; anchors the injury shelf","Bei ndogo sana, mzunguko mkubwa sana; ndiyo nguzo ya rafu ya majeraha"]],"mr_comp_kt":[["Kinesiology tape is a stretchy cotton tape with a wave-pattern adhesive that is applied to the skin over muscles and joints. It gives light support and feedback without blocking movement, and many athletes and physiotherapists use it for knee, shoulder, back and ankle strains; evidence for pain relief is modest but it is safe and well tolerated. Apply it to clean, dry, hair-free skin, round the corners of each strip to stop peeling, and rub it after application to activate the adhesive. A strip can stay on for three to five days and through showers. Do not apply over broken skin, and remove it if itching or a rash develops. Afya stocks it because it is popular with young sports customers and physiotherapy patients and is a high-margin item.","Tepu ya kinesiolojia ni tepu ya pamba inayonyooka yenye gundi ya mtindo wa mawimbi inayobandikwa kwenye ngozi juu ya misuli na viungo. Hutoa msaada mwepesi na hisia bila kuzuia mwendo, na wanamichezo wengi na wataalamu wa tiba ya viungo huitumia kwa mishtuko ya goti, bega, mgongo na kifundo cha mguu; ushahidi wa kupunguza maumivu ni wa wastani lakini ni salama na huvumilika vizuri. Ibandike kwenye ngozi safi, kavu isiyo na nywele, kata pembe za kila kipande ziwe duara ili zisibanduke, na uisugue baada ya kubandika ili kuamsha gundi. Kipande kinaweza kukaa siku tatu hadi tano hata wakati wa kuoga. Usiibandike juu ya ngozi iliyochubuka, na uiondoe ikiwa muwasho au vipele vitatokea. Afya inaiuza kwa sababu inapendwa na wateja vijana wa michezo na wagonjwa wa tiba ya viungo na ina faida kubwa."],["Trendy sports item with high margin and repeat use","Bidhaa ya michezo inayovuma yenye faida kubwa na matumizi ya kurudia"]],"mr_w_island":[["An island dressing is a sterile absorbent pad in the centre of a soft adhesive border, so it covers a surgical incision or larger wound in one step without separate gauze and tape. It is the standard dressing for clean, closed surgical wounds at home, such as after caesarean section, appendix or hernia operations. Choose a size that leaves at least 2 cm of border on intact skin all round the wound, wash hands before changing it, and change it when it is wet, soiled or as the clinic advises, often every two to three days. Signs of infection, such as spreading redness, heat, pus, a bad smell or fever, need the clinic promptly. Non-woven island dressings are breathable and gentle on skin, which matters in the Dar es Salaam heat. Afya stocks two trusted brands in multi-packs for the full healing period.","Plasta ya kidonda yenye pedi katikati ni pedi tasa inayofyonza iliyo katikati ya ukingo laini wenye gundi, hivyo hufunika kidonda cha upasuaji au kidonda kikubwa kwa hatua moja bila shashi na tepu tofauti. Ndiyo plasta ya kawaida kwa vidonda safi vilivyoshonwa vya upasuaji nyumbani, kama baada ya kujifungua kwa upasuaji, upasuaji wa kidole tumbo au ngiri. Chagua saizi inayoacha angalau sentimita 2 za ukingo kwenye ngozi salama kuzunguka kidonda, nawa mikono kabla ya kuibadilisha, na uibadilishe inapolowa, kuchafuka au kama kliniki ilivyoshauri, mara nyingi kila siku mbili hadi tatu. Dalili za maambukizi, kama wekundu unaosambaa, joto, usaha, harufu mbaya au homa, zinahitaji kliniki haraka. Plasta zisizofumwa hupitisha hewa na ni laini kwa ngozi, jambo muhimu katika joto la Dar es Salaam. Afya inauza chapa mbili zinazoaminika kwa paketi kubwa za kutosha kipindi chote cha kupona."],["Every surgical discharge needs a supply; repeat purchase over several weeks","Kila anayeruhusiwa baada ya upasuaji anahitaji akiba; ununuzi wa kurudia kwa wiki kadhaa"]],"mr_w_film":[["A showerproof post-operative dressing combines an absorbent pad with a thin transparent film that keeps water and bacteria out while letting moisture vapour escape. It allows a person to shower normally from the day after surgery and to see the wound through the film without removing it. It suits caesarean, joint replacement and abdominal incisions, and is useful in Dar es Salaam where heat and sweat loosen ordinary dressings. Apply it to clean, completely dry skin without stretching the film, and remove it by stretching the edge sideways rather than peeling upwards, which protects fragile skin. Change it if fluid reaches the edge of the pad. Afya stocks a leading brand because patients are often told to buy this exact type before leaving hospital.","Plasta ya kidonda isiyopitisha maji ya baada ya upasuaji huunganisha pedi inayofyonza na filamu nyembamba inayoonyesha ndani inayozuia maji na bakteria huku ikiruhusu mvuke wa unyevu kutoka. Humruhusu mtu kuoga kama kawaida kuanzia siku inayofuata upasuaji na kuona kidonda kupitia filamu bila kuiondoa. Inafaa vidonda vya kujifungua kwa upasuaji, kubadilishwa kiungo na upasuaji wa tumbo, na ni muhimu Dar es Salaam ambapo joto na jasho hulegeza plasta za kawaida. Ibandike kwenye ngozi safi iliyokauka kabisa bila kuvuta filamu, na uiondoe kwa kuvuta ukingo kwa pembeni badala ya kuibandua juu, jambo linalolinda ngozi dhaifu. Ibadilishe ikiwa majimaji yanafika ukingoni mwa pedi. Afya inauza chapa inayoongoza kwa sababu wagonjwa mara nyingi huambiwa wanunue aina hii kabla ya kutoka hospitalini."],["Premium, hospital-recommended dressing with strong margin and low competition","Plasta ya hadhi ya juu inayopendekezwa na hospitali yenye faida kubwa na ushindani mdogo"]],"mr_w_gauze":[["Sterile gauze swabs are folded cotton squares packed so they stay germ-free until opened, used to clean a wound with saline, to pad a wound under a bandage, and to build a dressing of any size. Low-adherent dressing pads have a perforated film that does not stick to a healing wound, making changes less painful. Choose 5 cm pads for small wounds and 7.5 or 10 cm swabs for larger areas, and buy enough for daily changes over one to two weeks. Open packs only with clean hands, touch only the edges, and never reuse a swab. Large bulk packs suit carers changing dressings every day for bedsores or diabetic wounds. Afya stocks bulk and small packs because these are the basic building blocks of any home wound-care routine.","Shashi tasa ni miraba ya pamba iliyokunjwa na kufungashwa ili ibaki bila vijidudu hadi ifunguliwe, hutumiwa kusafisha kidonda kwa maji ya chumvi, kufunika kidonda chini ya bendeji, na kutengeneza plasta ya saizi yoyote. Pedi za kidonda zisizonata zina filamu yenye matundu isiyoshikamana na kidonda kinachopona, jambo linalofanya kubadilisha kusiume sana. Chagua pedi za sentimita 5 kwa vidonda vidogo na shashi za sentimita 7.5 au 10 kwa maeneo makubwa, na nunua za kutosha kubadilisha kila siku kwa wiki moja hadi mbili. Fungua paketi kwa mikono safi tu, gusa pembe pekee, na kamwe usitumie shashi tena. Paketi kubwa zinafaa wahudumu wanaobadilisha plasta kila siku kwa vidonda vya kulalia au vidonda vya kisukari. Afya inauza paketi kubwa na ndogo kwa sababu hizi ndizo msingi wa kila utaratibu wa kutunza vidonda nyumbani."],["Staple consumable with steady repeat sales from carers and clinics","Bidhaa ya matumizi ya msingi yenye mauzo ya kurudia kutoka kwa wahudumu na kliniki"]],"mr_w_tape":[["Medical tape holds gauze and dressings in place. Paper (micropore) tape is gentle, breathable and easy to tear, so it suits fragile older skin and daily dressing changes; zinc-oxide tape is a strong cloth tape that grips firmly and is used for strapping and for securing bulky dressings or tubing. Apply tape without stretching, leaving it to lie flat, and remove it slowly by folding it back on itself while supporting the skin, to avoid skin tears. Rotate where the tape sits if dressings are changed daily, and stop if the skin becomes red or itchy. One 2.5 cm roll usually lasts a week or two of daily changes. Afya stocks a branded multi-roll box and low-cost zinc-oxide rolls because tape is needed with nearly every wound-care purchase.","Tepu ya kitabibu hushikilia shashi na plasta mahali pake. Tepu ya karatasi (micropore) ni laini, hupitisha hewa na ni rahisi kuikata kwa mkono, hivyo inafaa ngozi dhaifu ya wazee na kubadilisha plasta kila siku; tepu ya zinki oksaidi ni tepu imara ya kitambaa inayoshika kwa nguvu na hutumiwa kufunga viungo na kushikilia plasta nzito au mirija. Bandika tepu bila kuivuta, iache ilale bapa, na uiondoe polepole kwa kuikunja nyuma juu yake huku ukishikilia ngozi, ili kuepuka kuchanika kwa ngozi. Badilisha mahali tepu inapokaa ikiwa plasta hubadilishwa kila siku, na acha ikiwa ngozi inakuwa nyekundu au kuwasha. Roli moja ya sentimita 2.5 kwa kawaida hudumu wiki moja au mbili za kubadilisha kila siku. Afya inauza boksi la roli nyingi la chapa na roli za zinki oksaidi za bei ndogo kwa sababu tepu huhitajika karibu kila mara mtu anaponunua vifaa vya kutunza kidonda."],["Essential add-on to every dressing sale; tiny shelf footprint","Nyongeza muhimu kwa kila mauzo ya plasta; huchukua nafasi ndogo sana rafuni"]],"mr_w_scar_gel":[["Silicone scar gel forms a thin, breathable film over a healed scar that keeps it hydrated and reduces the overactive collagen production that makes scars raised, red and itchy. It is a first-line option for preventing and treating hypertrophic scars and keloids, which are more common in people with darker skin and are a frequent concern after caesarean section, ear piercing and burns. Start only once the wound has fully closed and stitches are out, apply a very thin layer twice a day, and continue for at least two to three months. Gels with sunscreen protect new scars from darkening in the sun, which is important in Tanzania. An existing large keloid should be seen by a doctor, as it may need injections. Afya stocks three brands because scar concerns are a common, emotionally important reason customers return after surgery.","Jeli ya silikoni ya kovu huunda utando mwembamba unaopitisha hewa juu ya kovu lililopona unaoliweka na unyevu na kupunguza utengenezaji uliokithiri wa kolajeni unaofanya makovu kuinuka, kuwa mekundu na kuwasha. Ni chaguo la kwanza la kuzuia na kutibu makovu yaliyoinuka na keloidi, ambayo ni ya kawaida zaidi kwa watu wenye ngozi nyeusi na ni wasiwasi wa mara kwa mara baada ya kujifungua kwa upasuaji, kutoboa masikio na kuungua. Anza tu baada ya kidonda kufunga kabisa na nyuzi kuondolewa, paka tabaka jembamba sana mara mbili kwa siku, na endelea kwa angalau miezi miwili hadi mitatu. Jeli zenye kinga ya jua hulinda makovu mapya yasiwe meusi juani, jambo muhimu Tanzania. Keloidi kubwa iliyopo ionwe na daktari, kwani inaweza kuhitaji sindano. Afya inauza chapa tatu kwa sababu wasiwasi kuhusu makovu ni sababu ya kawaida na yenye uzito wa kihisia inayowarudisha wateja baada ya upasuaji."],["Premium skin-care product with emotional value and a long treatment course","Bidhaa ya hadhi ya juu ya ngozi yenye thamani ya kihisia na kipindi kirefu cha matibabu"]],"mr_w_scar_sheet":[["Silicone gel sheets are soft, reusable, self-adhesive pads placed over a healed scar, where they hydrate the scar and apply gentle pressure; they are one of the best-studied non-invasive treatments for raised scars and keloids. They suit long straight scars such as caesarean, sternal or knee-replacement incisions, and burn scars, especially where clothing would rub off a gel. Cut the sheet to cover the scar with a small margin, wear it for 12 or more hours a day, and wash it daily with mild soap so it stays sticky; one sheet usually lasts a couple of weeks. Treatment typically runs for three months or longer. Stop if a rash develops, and do not apply to open wounds. Afya stocks a leading brand in single-sheet and multi-pack sizes.","Shiti za jeli ya silikoni ni pedi laini zinazotumika tena zenye gundi yake zinazowekwa juu ya kovu lililopona, ambapo hulipa unyevu na kulibana kwa upole; ni mojawapo ya tiba zisizo za upasuaji zilizochunguzwa zaidi kwa makovu yaliyoinuka na keloidi. Zinafaa makovu marefu yaliyonyooka kama ya kujifungua kwa upasuaji, ya kifua au ya kubadilishwa goti, na makovu ya kuungua, hasa mahali ambapo nguo zingefuta jeli. Kata shiti ifunike kovu na ukingo mdogo, ivae kwa saa 12 au zaidi kwa siku, na uioshe kila siku kwa sabuni laini ili ibaki ikinata; shiti moja kwa kawaida hudumu wiki kadhaa. Matibabu kwa kawaida huchukua miezi mitatu au zaidi. Acha ikiwa vipele vinatokea, na usiiweke juu ya vidonda vilivyo wazi. Afya inauza chapa inayoongoza kwa ukubwa wa shiti moja na paketi ya shiti kadhaa."],["High-value specialist scar product with little local availability","Bidhaa ya kitaalamu ya kovu ya thamani kubwa inayopatikana kwa shida hapa nchini"]],"mr_w_cast":[["A cast protector is a reusable waterproof sleeve with a tight rubber seal at the top that slides over a plaster cast, splint or dressing so a person can shower or bathe without wetting it. A wet plaster cast softens, loses its hold on the fracture and can cause skin infection underneath, while plastic bags taped around the limb often leak. Choose by limb (arm, leg or foot) and length, and by the circumference of the limb at the seal. Put it on and take it off slowly, sitting down, and dry the outside before removing it to stop drips running inside. It is not designed for swimming unless stated, and should not be worn for long periods. Afya stocks arm and leg versions because thousands of people wear casts each year after road and household injuries.","Kifuniko cha plasta ngumu ni mfuko usiopitisha maji unaotumika tena wenye mpira unaobana juu unaoingizwa juu ya plasta ngumu, banzi au plasta ya kidonda ili mtu aweze kuoga bila kuilowesha. Plasta ngumu iliyolowa hulainika, hupoteza uwezo wa kushikilia mfupa uliovunjika na inaweza kusababisha maambukizi ya ngozi chini yake, wakati mifuko ya plastiki iliyofungwa kwa tepu mara nyingi huvuja. Chagua kulingana na kiungo (mkono, mguu au unyayo) na urefu, na mzunguko wa kiungo mahali mpira unapobana. Kivae na kukivua polepole ukiwa umeketi, na kausha nje kabla ya kukivua ili matone yasiingie ndani. Hakijaundwa kwa kuogelea isipokuwa imeelezwa, na kisivaliwe kwa muda mrefu. Afya inauza aina za mkono na mguu kwa sababu maelfu ya watu huvaa plasta ngumu kila mwaka baada ya ajali za barabarani na za nyumbani."],["Problem-solving item customers rarely know exists; strong staff-led add-on to crutches and slings","Bidhaa inayotatua tatizo ambayo wateja mara chache wanajua ipo; nyongeza nzuri inayopendekezwa na wafanyakazi pamoja na magongo na kombeo"]],"mr_p_hcpack":[["A reusable gel pack can be cooled in the freezer or warmed in hot water or a microwave, so one product covers both cold and heat therapy. Cold is used in the first 48 to 72 hours after a sprain, bruise or strain to reduce swelling and pain; heat is used for stiff muscles, back ache and arthritis once any swelling has settled. Always wrap the pack in a thin cloth, apply it for 15 to 20 minutes at a time, and check the skin every few minutes; never sleep on a pack. People with diabetes, poor circulation or numbness should take extra care because they may not feel a burn or frost injury. A pack with a fabric cover and strap can be held in place around a knee or shoulder. Afya stocks two trusted brands as a durable alternative to ice in a bag.","Pakiti ya jeli inayotumika tena inaweza kupozwa kwenye friza au kupashwa joto kwenye maji ya moto au microwave, hivyo bidhaa moja hutumika kwa tiba ya baridi na ya joto. Baridi hutumiwa katika saa 48 hadi 72 za kwanza baada ya kuteguka, kuvilia damu au mshtuko ili kupunguza uvimbe na maumivu; joto hutumiwa kwa misuli iliyokakamaa, maumivu ya mgongo na baridi yabisi uvimbe ukishapungua. Daima funga pakiti kwa kitambaa chembamba, iweke kwa dakika 15 hadi 20 kila mara, na kagua ngozi kila baada ya dakika chache; kamwe usilale juu ya pakiti. Watu wenye kisukari, mzunguko hafifu wa damu au ganzi wachukue tahadhari zaidi kwa sababu huenda wasihisi kuungua kwa joto au baridi. Pakiti yenye kifuniko cha kitambaa na mkanda inaweza kushikiliwa kuzunguka goti au bega. Afya inauza chapa mbili zinazoaminika kama mbadala imara wa barafu kwenye mfuko."],["One product for two therapies; durable gift and sports item with good margin","Bidhaa moja kwa tiba mbili; zawadi na bidhaa ya michezo imara yenye faida nzuri"]],"mr_p_hwb":[["A hot-water bottle is a simple, electricity-free way to apply soothing heat to a sore back, stiff joints or period cramps. Fill it two-thirds with hot, not boiling, water from a kettle that has cooled for a few minutes, squeeze out the air before screwing the stopper tight, and always use a fleece or fabric cover. Check the rubber for cracks and replace any bottle older than about two years, as the date flower on the neck shows its age. Never sit or lie on the bottle, and take special care with children, older adults and anyone with numbness, who burn easily. A good bottle with a cover is a comforting gift for elders during the cool June to August months. Afya stocks value, mid and premium bottles, including an Afya own-label option.","Chupa ya maji ya moto ni njia rahisi isiyotumia umeme ya kutoa joto linalotuliza kwa mgongo unaouma, viungo vilivyokakamaa au maumivu ya hedhi. Ijaze theluthi mbili kwa maji ya moto, si yanayochemka, kutoka kwenye birika lililopoa kwa dakika chache, kamua hewa itoke kabla ya kufunga kizibo kwa nguvu, na daima tumia kifuniko cha manyoya au kitambaa. Kagua mpira kama una nyufa na badilisha chupa yoyote yenye umri zaidi ya takriban miaka miwili, kwani alama ya tarehe shingoni huonyesha umri wake. Kamwe usikalie wala kulalia chupa, na chukua tahadhari maalum kwa watoto, wazee na yeyote mwenye ganzi, ambao huungua kwa urahisi. Chupa nzuri yenye kifuniko ni zawadi ya faraja kwa wazee katika miezi ya baridi ya Juni hadi Agosti. Afya inauza chupa za bei nafuu, kati na hadhi ya juu, ikiwemo chaguo la chapa ya Afya."],["Low-cost comfort item with own-label margin and seasonal gifting peaks","Bidhaa ya faraja ya bei ndogo yenye faida ya chapa yetu na kilele cha zawadi kwa msimu"]],"mr_p_heatpad":[["An electric heating pad gives steady, controllable heat for chronic muscle and joint pain, without refilling like a hot-water bottle. Look for several heat settings, an automatic switch-off after about 90 minutes, a washable cover and overheat protection; shaped pads for the neck and shoulders wrap the area more evenly. Use it on a low or medium setting for 20 to 30 minutes, with a layer of clothing between pad and skin, and never fall asleep with it switched on. It is not suitable for people who cannot feel heat properly, over areas treated with heat rubs, or on fresh injuries. A branded pad with a warranty is safer than unbranded electrical goods. Afya stocks a compact and a large-area model from a reputable medical-device brand.","Pedi ya joto ya umeme hutoa joto thabiti linalodhibitiwa kwa maumivu sugu ya misuli na viungo, bila kujaza tena kama chupa ya maji ya moto. Tafuta viwango kadhaa vya joto, kuzima kwenyewe baada ya takriban dakika 90, kifuniko kinachofuliwa na kinga dhidi ya joto kupita kiasi; pedi zenye umbo la shingo na mabega hufunika eneo kwa usawa zaidi. Itumie kwenye kiwango cha chini au cha kati kwa dakika 20 hadi 30, kukiwa na tabaka la nguo kati ya pedi na ngozi, na kamwe usilale ikiwa imewashwa. Haifai watu wasioweza kuhisi joto vizuri, juu ya maeneo yaliyopakwa dawa za joto, au kwenye majeraha mapya. Pedi ya chapa yenye dhamana ni salama zaidi kuliko vifaa vya umeme visivyo na chapa. Afya inauza aina ndogo na ya eneo kubwa kutoka chapa ya vifaa tiba inayoheshimika."],["Device with warranty and strong margin; gift appeal for elders","Kifaa chenye dhamana na faida kubwa; huvutia kama zawadi kwa wazee"]],"mr_p_coldgel":[["A cold-therapy gel contains menthol, which produces a cooling sensation that eases pain from knocks, sprains and overworked muscles; it is convenient when ice is not available, such as on the football pitch or at work. Rub a thin layer into the skin over the painful area up to three or four times a day and wash hands afterwards to keep it away from the eyes. It soothes pain but does not reduce deep swelling as well as a true cold pack, so use both after a significant sprain. Do not apply to broken or irritated skin, under tight bandages or with a heat pad, and avoid in young children unless the label allows. Afya stocks the familiar 35 g and 100 g sizes because they sell steadily to sports players and manual workers.","Jeli ya tiba ya baridi ina menthol, inayoleta hisia ya ubaridi inayopunguza maumivu ya kugongwa, miteguko na misuli iliyofanya kazi kupita kiasi; ni rahisi kutumia barafu isipopatikana, kama uwanjani au kazini. Paka tabaka jembamba kwenye ngozi juu ya eneo linalouma hadi mara tatu au nne kwa siku na nawa mikono baadaye ili isifike machoni. Hutuliza maumivu lakini haipunguzi uvimbe wa ndani vizuri kama pakiti halisi ya baridi, hivyo tumia vyote viwili baada ya mteguko mkubwa. Usipake kwenye ngozi iliyochubuka au iliyowashwa, chini ya bendeji zinazobana au pamoja na pedi ya joto, na epuka kwa watoto wadogo isipokuwa lebo inaruhusu. Afya inauza saizi zinazojulikana za gramu 35 na 100 kwa sababu huuzika kwa kudumu kwa wachezaji na wafanyakazi wa nguvu."],["Trusted brand with steady turnover; small, high-value-per-shelf item","Chapa inayoaminika yenye mzunguko wa kudumu; bidhaa ndogo yenye thamani kubwa kwa nafasi ya rafu"]],"mr_p_heatrub":[["Heat rubs contain methyl salicylate and menthol, which warm the skin and distract from muscle and joint pain; they are a long-trusted remedy for stiff backs, shoulders and legs after hard work or exercise. Creams and rubs are massaged into the skin, while a spray is quick, mess-free and reaches the back without help. Use up to three times a day, wash hands after applying, and keep away from eyes, broken skin and the genital area. Never combine with a heat pad or hot-water bottle, which can cause burns, and do not use on children under the age stated on the pack. People who are allergic to aspirin, who are pregnant or who take blood thinners should ask a pharmacist first, as the salicylate is absorbed. Afya stocks the popular cream, rub and spray sizes.","Dawa za kupaka za joto zina methyl salicylate na menthol, zinazopasha ngozi joto na kuondoa umakini kwenye maumivu ya misuli na viungo; ni tiba inayoaminika tangu zamani kwa migongo, mabega na miguu iliyokakamaa baada ya kazi ngumu au mazoezi. Krimu na marhamu husuguliwa kwenye ngozi, wakati dawa ya kupuliza ni ya haraka, haichafui na hufika mgongoni bila msaada. Tumia hadi mara tatu kwa siku, nawa mikono baada ya kupaka, na weka mbali na macho, ngozi iliyochubuka na sehemu za siri. Kamwe usiichanganye na pedi ya joto au chupa ya maji ya moto, jambo linaloweza kusababisha kuungua, na usitumie kwa watoto walio chini ya umri ulioandikwa kwenye pakiti. Wenye mzio wa aspirini, wajawazito au wanaotumia dawa za kuzuia damu kuganda wamuulize mfamasia kwanza, kwani salicylate hufyonzwa mwilini. Afya inauza saizi maarufu za krimu, marhamu na dawa ya kupuliza."],["Household name with very steady sales across ages and seasons","Jina linalojulikana nyumbani lenye mauzo ya kudumu sana kwa rika na misimu yote"]],"mr_p_heatpatch":[["Self-heating patches contain iron powder that warms when exposed to air, giving gentle heat for up to eight hours under clothing; they let people with back or neck pain keep working, driving or travelling without a hot-water bottle. Medicated patches instead release menthol or methyl salicylate into the skin over the painful area. Apply heat patches over a thin layer of clothing or directly to skin only if the pack says so, never while sleeping, and never with other heat sources; check the skin regularly, especially in older people. Do not use on broken skin, and people with diabetes or poor sensation should avoid self-heating patches unless advised. Afya stocks a single heat patch and a medicated multi-pack as discreet alternatives to creams.","Plasta zinazojipasha joto zina unga wa chuma unaopata joto zikiguswa na hewa, zikitoa joto la upole kwa hadi saa nane chini ya nguo; huwawezesha watu wenye maumivu ya mgongo au shingo kuendelea kufanya kazi, kuendesha au kusafiri bila chupa ya maji ya moto. Plasta zenye dawa badala yake hutoa menthol au methyl salicylate kwenye ngozi juu ya eneo linalouma. Bandika plasta za joto juu ya tabaka jembamba la nguo au moja kwa moja kwenye ngozi ikiwa tu pakiti inaruhusu, kamwe si wakati wa kulala, na kamwe si pamoja na vyanzo vingine vya joto; kagua ngozi mara kwa mara, hasa kwa wazee. Usitumie kwenye ngozi iliyochubuka, na wenye kisukari au hisia hafifu waepuke plasta zinazojipasha joto isipokuwa wameshauriwa. Afya inauza plasta moja ya joto na paketi ya plasta zenye dawa kama mbadala wa siri wa krimu."],["Impulse-friendly till item with good margin per unit","Bidhaa ya kununua ghafla karibu na kaunta yenye faida nzuri kwa kila kipande"]],"mr_p_nsaid":[["Diclofenac gel is a non-steroidal anti-inflammatory medicine applied to the skin, which delivers the medicine to the painful joint with far less of it reaching the stomach, kidneys and heart than tablets. NICE recommends topical NSAIDs as the first medicine for osteoarthritis of the knee and hand, and they are also effective for sprains and strains. Rub a small amount gently into the skin over the painful area three to four times a day and wash hands afterwards; do not cover with tight bandages or use on broken skin. Adults only, unless the pack says otherwise; avoid in the last three months of pregnancy, and ask a pharmacist first if allergic to aspirin or ibuprofen, or if you have asthma. It is sold as a pharmacy-only general sales product in East Africa. Afya stocks the leading brand because it is safer than tablets for long-term joint pain.","Jeli ya diclofenac ni dawa ya kupunguza uvimbe isiyo ya steroidi inayopakwa kwenye ngozi, ikipeleka dawa kwenye kiungo kinachouma huku kiasi kidogo sana kikifika tumboni, kwenye figo na moyoni ukilinganisha na vidonge. NICE inapendekeza dawa za kupaka za aina hii kama dawa ya kwanza ya baridi yabisi ya goti na mkono, na pia zinafaa kwa miteguko na mishtuko. Sugua kiasi kidogo taratibu kwenye ngozi juu ya eneo linalouma mara tatu hadi nne kwa siku na nawa mikono baadaye; usifunike kwa bendeji zinazobana wala kutumia kwenye ngozi iliyochubuka. Kwa watu wazima tu, isipokuwa pakiti inasema vinginevyo; epuka katika miezi mitatu ya mwisho ya ujauzito, na muulize mfamasia kwanza ikiwa una mzio wa aspirini au ibuprofen, au una pumu. Huuzwa kama dawa ya duka la dawa isiyohitaji agizo katika Afrika Mashariki. Afya inauza chapa inayoongoza kwa sababu ni salama zaidi kuliko vidonge kwa maumivu ya viungo ya muda mrefu."],["Guideline-backed first choice for arthritis with loyal repeat buyers","Chaguo la kwanza linaloungwa mkono na miongozo kwa baridi yabisi, lenye wanunuzi waaminifu wanaorudi"]],"mr_r_band":[["Resistance loop bands are elastic loops in graded strengths that physiotherapists use for home exercise programmes: leg raises, clam shells, side steps, rows and shoulder rotations. Strengthening the muscles around a joint is the most effective long-term treatment for knee and hip arthritis and one of the best ways to prevent falls in older people, and bands make it cheap, portable and safe. Start with the lightest band, do 10 to 15 slow repetitions, and move up a level only when the exercise feels easy. Check bands for nicks before each use and keep them out of strong sun, which perishes latex; latex-free bands suit people with allergies. Ask a physiotherapist for a programme suited to your condition. Afya stocks multi-strength sets because they support recovery long after the brace is put away.","Bendi za mazoezi za kukinza ni pete za elastiki zenye nguvu za viwango tofauti ambazo wataalamu wa tiba ya viungo hutumia kwa programu za mazoezi ya nyumbani: kuinua miguu, mazoezi ya kufungua nyonga, kutembea pembeni, kuvuta na kuzungusha mabega. Kuimarisha misuli inayozunguka kiungo ndiyo tiba yenye ufanisi zaidi ya muda mrefu kwa baridi yabisi ya goti na nyonga na mojawapo ya njia bora za kuzuia wazee kuanguka, na bendi hufanya hivyo kuwa nafuu, rahisi kubeba na salama. Anza na bendi nyepesi zaidi, fanya marudio 10 hadi 15 ya polepole, na panda kiwango tu zoezi linapokuwa rahisi. Kagua bendi kama zina mipasuko kabla ya kila matumizi na ziweke mbali na jua kali, linaloharibu mpira; bendi zisizo na mpira asilia zinafaa wenye mzio. Muulize mtaalamu wa tiba ya viungo akupe programu inayofaa hali yako. Afya inauza seti za nguvu mbalimbali kwa sababu husaidia kupona muda mrefu baada ya brace kuwekwa kando."],["Cheap, light, physiotherapy-recommended item that keeps recovery customers returning","Bidhaa nafuu, nyepesi inayopendekezwa na wataalamu wa tiba ya viungo inayowafanya wateja wa kupona warudi"]],"mr_r_grip":[["After a wrist or hand fracture, a period in a cast, or a stroke, grip strength falls quickly and everyday tasks such as opening bottles or holding a cup become hard. An adjustable grip strengthener lets resistance start very low and increase week by week, while finger extensor bands work the muscles that open the hand, which are often neglected. Use it little and often: two or three sets of ten slow squeezes, stopping if pain increases or swelling returns. People with rheumatoid arthritis should use only light resistance and follow advice from a therapist. These small tools are inexpensive and portable, so patients can exercise while watching television or travelling. Afya stocks adjustable kits because they make hand therapy practical at home.","Baada ya kuvunjika kiwiko cha mkono au kiganja, kipindi cha plasta ngumu, au kiharusi, nguvu ya kushika hupungua haraka na kazi za kila siku kama kufungua chupa au kushika kikombe huwa ngumu. Kifaa cha kuongeza nguvu ya kushika kinachorekebishwa huruhusu ukinzani kuanza chini sana na kuongezeka wiki kwa wiki, wakati bendi za kunyoosha vidole hufanyisha kazi misuli inayofungua kiganja, ambayo mara nyingi husahaulika. Kitumie kidogo na mara kwa mara: seti mbili au tatu za kubana mara kumi polepole, ukiacha maumivu yakiongezeka au uvimbe ukirudi. Watu wenye baridi yabisi ya rheumatoid watumie ukinzani mwepesi tu na wafuate ushauri wa mtaalamu. Vifaa hivi vidogo ni nafuu na rahisi kubeba, hivyo wagonjwa wanaweza kufanya mazoezi wakitazama televisheni au wakisafiri. Afya inauza seti zinazorekebishwa kwa sababu zinafanya tiba ya mkono iwezekane nyumbani."],["Low-cost rehab add-on to wrist splints and slings","Nyongeza ya urekebishaji ya bei ndogo kwa banzi za kiwiko cha mkono na kombeo"]],"mr_r_pedal":[["A pedal exerciser is a small frame with pedals that sits on the floor in front of a chair, or on a table for the arms, allowing gentle cycling without standing. It improves circulation, joint range and stamina for people recovering from knee or hip surgery, stroke or a long hospital stay, and for older adults who cannot walk far. Adjust the tension knob to start almost free-wheeling and pedal for five to ten minutes two or three times a day, building up gradually. Place it on a non-slip mat and use a stable chair with arms so the exerciser does not slide away. Stop if there is chest pain, dizziness or breathlessness. Afya stocks it because it brings exercise into the home of people who cannot get to a gym or clinic.","Baiskeli ndogo ya mazoezi ni fremu ndogo yenye pedali inayowekwa sakafuni mbele ya kiti, au mezani kwa ajili ya mikono, ikiruhusu kuendesha kwa upole bila kusimama. Huboresha mzunguko wa damu, mwendo wa viungo na stamina kwa wanaopona baada ya upasuaji wa goti au nyonga, kiharusi au kulazwa hospitalini muda mrefu, na kwa wazee wasioweza kutembea mbali. Rekebisha kitufe cha ukinzani kuanza karibu bila kukinza na endesha kwa dakika tano hadi kumi mara mbili au tatu kwa siku, ukiongeza taratibu. Iweke juu ya mkeka usioteleza na tumia kiti imara chenye vishikio vya mikono ili isiteleze mbali. Acha ikiwa kuna maumivu ya kifua, kizunguzungu au kukosa pumzi. Afya inaiuza kwa sababu inaleta mazoezi nyumbani kwa wasioweza kufika gym au kliniki."],["Distinctive, giftable rehab device with a strong margin","Kifaa cha kipekee cha urekebishaji kinachofaa kama zawadi chenye faida kubwa"]],"mr_r_tens":[["A TENS (transcutaneous electrical nerve stimulation) unit sends small, comfortable electrical pulses through sticky pads on the skin, which can block pain signals and encourage the body’s own pain relief. Many people with chronic back pain, neck pain, arthritis or period pain find it helpful, and it can reduce the need for tablets; responses vary, so it is worth a trial. Choose a unit with adjustable intensity and several programmes, at least two channels, and easy-to-find replacement pads; rechargeable units save on batteries. Place pads around, not on, the painful area, start at a low intensity and use for 20 to 60 minutes. Do not use TENS with a pacemaker or other implanted device, over the front of the neck, on broken skin, while driving, or in early pregnancy without advice. Afya stocks two- and four-channel units with spare pads for repeat sales.","Kifaa cha TENS hutuma mipigo midogo ya umeme isiyoumiza kupitia pedi zinazonata kwenye ngozi, inayoweza kuzuia ishara za maumivu na kuchochea uwezo wa mwili wenyewe wa kupunguza maumivu. Watu wengi wenye maumivu sugu ya mgongo, shingo, baridi yabisi au maumivu ya hedhi hukiona kinasaidia, na kinaweza kupunguza haja ya vidonge; matokeo hutofautiana, hivyo inafaa kukijaribu. Chagua kifaa chenye nguvu inayorekebishwa na programu kadhaa, angalau njia mbili, na pedi za kubadilisha zinazopatikana kwa urahisi; vifaa vinavyochajiwa huokoa gharama za betri. Weka pedi kuzunguka eneo linalouma, si juu yake, anza kwa nguvu ndogo na tumia kwa dakika 20 hadi 60. Usitumie TENS ukiwa na kifaa cha kusaidia moyo au kifaa kingine kilichopandikizwa mwilini, mbele ya shingo, kwenye ngozi iliyochubuka, wakati wa kuendesha, au katika ujauzito wa mwanzo bila ushauri. Afya inauza vifaa vya njia mbili na nne pamoja na pedi za ziada kwa mauzo ya kurudia."],["Higher-value device with consumable pad sales and a drug-free story customers value","Kifaa cha thamani kubwa chenye mauzo ya pedi za matumizi na sifa ya kutotumia dawa inayowavutia wateja"]],"mr_r_massage":[["A firm or spiked massage ball lets a person apply self-massage to tight spots in the muscles, such as the calves, the arch of the foot, between the shoulder blades and the buttocks. Rolling the arch over a ball for a few minutes in the morning is a simple, well-used routine for plantar heel pain, and leaning against a wall with a ball behind the shoulder eases desk-related stiffness. Use slow, moderate pressure for one to two minutes per area, avoiding bones, bruises, varicose veins and recent injuries. People with diabetes and numb feet, or those on blood thinners, should be gentle and check for bruising. Afya stocks a value spiked ball and a premium whole-body ball as affordable recovery tools.","Mpira mgumu au wenye miiba wa kukanda humwezesha mtu kujikanda mwenyewe mahali palipokaza kwenye misuli, kama ndama, upinde wa unyayo, kati ya vile vya mabega na makalio. Kuviringisha upinde wa unyayo juu ya mpira kwa dakika chache asubuhi ni utaratibu rahisi unaotumiwa sana kwa maumivu ya kisigino, na kuegemea ukuta ukiwa na mpira nyuma ya bega hupunguza kukakamaa kunakotokana na kukaa mezani. Tumia mbinyo wa polepole wa wastani kwa dakika moja hadi mbili kwa kila eneo, ukiepuka mifupa, michubuko, mishipa ya varikosi na majeraha mapya. Watu wenye kisukari na miguu yenye ganzi, au wanaotumia dawa za kuzuia damu kuganda, wawe waangalifu na wakague michubuko. Afya inauza mpira wa miiba wa bei nafuu na mpira wa mwili mzima wa hadhi ya juu kama vifaa nafuu vya kupona."],["Impulse-priced recovery tool that pairs with heel cups and insoles","Kifaa cha kupona cha bei ya kununua ghafla kinachoendana na vikombe vya kisigino na soli"]],"mr_b_grab":[["A screw-fixed grab bar is the single most effective change to make a bathroom safer: it gives a solid handhold for sitting down and standing up from the toilet, stepping into the shower and keeping balance on wet floors, where most home falls happen. Choose stainless steel or a ribbed, non-slip coated bar 30 to 60 cm long, and fix it into solid masonry with the wall plugs and screws provided; it must never be fixed to tiles alone or to plasterboard. Mount it beside the toilet at about hip height and vertically or diagonally at the shower entry. A properly installed bar supports the full weight of an adult, unlike suction bars or towel rails, which must never be used for support. WHO identifies home modifications as a key step in preventing falls in older adults. Afya stocks a range of lengths and can refer customers to a fundi for installation.","Kishikio kinachofungwa ukutani kwa skrubu ndiyo badiliko lenye ufanisi zaidi la kufanya bafu kuwa salama: hutoa mshiko imara wa kuketi na kusimama kutoka chooni, kuingia bafuni na kudumisha mizani kwenye sakafu yenye maji, ambapo kuanguka kwingi nyumbani hutokea. Chagua chuma kisichoshika kutu au kishikio chenye mikunjo kilichopakwa kitu kisichoteleza chenye urefu wa sentimita 30 hadi 60, na kikifunge kwenye ukuta imara wa matofali kwa plagi na skrubu zilizotolewa; kamwe kisifungwe kwenye vigae pekee au kwenye ubao wa jasi. Kiweke kando ya choo takriban usawa wa nyonga na wima au kwa mshazari kwenye mlango wa bafu. Kishikio kilichofungwa ipasavyo hubeba uzito kamili wa mtu mzima, tofauti na vishikio vya kunata au vishikio vya taulo, ambavyo kamwe havipaswi kutumika kujishikilia. Shirika la Afya Duniani linataja marekebisho ya nyumbani kama hatua muhimu ya kuzuia wazee kuanguka. Afya inauza urefu mbalimbali na inaweza kuwaelekeza wateja kwa fundi wa kufunga."],["Durable safety upgrade bought in multiples per home; strong margin and service add-on","Uboreshaji wa usalama wa kudumu unaonunuliwa kwa wingi kwa kila nyumba; faida kubwa na huduma ya ziada"]],"mr_b_suction":[["A suction grab handle attaches to smooth, non-porous tiles or glass with two large locking suction cups, so it can be fitted without drilling, which suits renters and travellers. It is meant for light balance assistance, steadying a hand while stepping into the shower, not for taking body weight when standing up or if a person slips. The tiles must be flat, clean and grout-free under each cup, and the cups must be checked before every use; many models have an indicator that shows when suction is weakening. Remove and re-seat the handle weekly. For anyone who needs to pull up or lean, a screw-fixed bar is the safe option. Afya stocks suction handles because they are an inexpensive first step and a frequent gift, and staff explain their limits clearly.","Kishikio cha kunata hujishikiza kwenye vigae laini visivyo na vitundu au kioo kwa vikombe viwili vikubwa vya kunata vinavyofungwa, hivyo kinaweza kuwekwa bila kutoboa, jambo linalowafaa wapangaji na wasafiri. Kimekusudiwa kwa msaada mwepesi wa mizani, kutuliza mkono wakati wa kuingia bafuni, si kubeba uzito wa mwili unaposimama au mtu anapoteleza. Vigae vinapaswa kuwa tambarare, safi na bila mistari ya saruji chini ya kila kikombe, na vikombe vikaguliwe kabla ya kila matumizi; aina nyingi zina kiashiria kinachoonyesha nguvu ya kunata inapopungua. Kiondoe na kukibandika upya kila wiki. Kwa yeyote anayehitaji kujivuta juu au kuegemea, kishikio kinachofungwa kwa skrubu ndiyo chaguo salama. Afya inauza vishikio vya kunata kwa sababu ni hatua ya kwanza nafuu na zawadi ya mara kwa mara, na wafanyakazi hueleza mipaka yake waziwazi."],["Low-price impulse safety item with a clear upgrade path to fixed bars","Bidhaa ya usalama ya bei ndogo ya kununua ghafla yenye njia ya wazi ya kupanda kwenda vishikio vya kudumu"]],"mr_b_toiletrail":[["Toilet armrests give a stable support on one or both sides of the toilet so a person can lower themselves and push up using their arms, which is often the hardest movement after hip or knee surgery and in advanced arthritis. A freestanding toilet frame or armrest needs no drilling and fits around most Western toilets, while a wall-mounted flip-up rail folds out of the way for other family members and takes more weight. Check the width between armrests, the height adjustment, rubber feet and the weight limit, and make sure the frame does not rock on uneven floors. Combine with a raised toilet seat when the toilet is low. Afya stocks a freestanding armrest and a fold-up rail because toilet transfers are a leading cause of bathroom falls.","Vishikio vya choo hutoa msaada imara upande mmoja au pande zote mbili za choo ili mtu ajishushe na kujisukuma juu akitumia mikono, ambao mara nyingi ndio mwendo mgumu zaidi baada ya upasuaji wa nyonga au goti na katika baridi yabisi iliyokithiri. Fremu ya choo inayosimama yenyewe haihitaji kutoboa na huzunguka vyoo vingi vya kukaa, wakati reli inayofungwa ukutani na kukunjwa juu hujikunja pembeni kwa ajili ya wanafamilia wengine na hubeba uzito zaidi. Kagua upana kati ya vishikio, urekebishaji wa urefu, nyayo za mpira na kiwango cha uzito, na hakikisha fremu haiyumbi kwenye sakafu zisizo sawa. Viambatanishe na kikalio cha choo kilichoinuliwa choo kinapokuwa chini. Afya inauza kishikio kinachosimama chenyewe na reli ya kukunja kwa sababu kuhamia na kutoka chooni ni chanzo kikuu cha kuanguka bafuni."],["High-value bathroom item usually bought with a raised seat and grab bars","Bidhaa ya bafu ya thamani kubwa ambayo kwa kawaida hununuliwa pamoja na kikalio kilichoinuliwa na vishikio"]],"mr_b_shower":[["A shower chair lets a person sit while washing, removing the risk of fainting or slipping on a wet floor, and is essential after hip, knee or abdominal surgery, during long illness and for frail older adults. Choose rust-proof aluminium legs with rubber feet, drainage holes in the seat, adjustable height so the knees are level with the hips, and a weight limit above the user’s weight. A model with a back and armrests is safer for weak users; a simple stool suits small shower spaces and people with good balance. Pair the chair with a hand-held shower head and a grab bar, and clean it weekly to prevent mould. Afya stocks a stool, a chair with handles and a premium model so families can match the shower space.","Kiti cha kuogea humwezesha mtu kuketi akioga, kikiondoa hatari ya kuzirai au kuteleza kwenye sakafu yenye maji, na ni muhimu baada ya upasuaji wa nyonga, goti au tumbo, wakati wa ugonjwa wa muda mrefu na kwa wazee dhaifu. Chagua miguu ya alumini isiyoshika kutu yenye nyayo za mpira, matundu ya kupitisha maji kwenye kiti, urefu unaorekebishwa ili magoti yawe sawa na nyonga, na kiwango cha uzito kinachozidi uzito wa mtumiaji. Aina yenye egemeo la mgongo na vishikio vya mikono ni salama zaidi kwa watumiaji dhaifu; kigoda rahisi kinafaa mabafu madogo na watu wenye mizani nzuri. Kiambatanishe na bomba la mvua la kushika mkononi na kishikio cha ukutani, na kisafishe kila wiki kuzuia ukungu. Afya inauza kigoda, kiti chenye vishikio na aina ya hadhi ya juu ili familia zilinganishe na nafasi ya bafu."],["Core bathroom-safety product with clear post-surgery demand","Bidhaa kuu ya usalama bafuni yenye mahitaji ya wazi baada ya upasuaji"]],"mr_b_raised":[["A raised toilet seat adds 10 to 15 cm of height to a standard toilet, so the hips do not bend as far and sitting down and standing up need much less effort. After hip replacement, surgeons often advise avoiding deep bending for several weeks, which makes a raised seat essential. Models with arms add support for pushing up; models with a lid are more hygienic in shared bathrooms. Check that the seat clamps or locks securely to the toilet bowl and does not rock, and that its inner opening suits the toilet shape. Clean it daily with ordinary bathroom disinfectant. Afya stocks lidded, lidless and armed versions because a raised seat is on almost every orthopaedic discharge checklist.","Kikalio cha choo kilichoinuliwa huongeza urefu wa sentimita 10 hadi 15 kwa choo cha kawaida, hivyo nyonga hazikunjiki sana na kuketi na kusimama kunahitaji juhudi ndogo zaidi. Baada ya kubadilishwa nyonga, madaktari wa upasuaji mara nyingi hushauri kuepuka kuinama sana kwa wiki kadhaa, jambo linalofanya kikalio kilichoinuliwa kuwa muhimu. Aina zenye vishikio huongeza msaada wa kujisukuma juu; aina zenye kifuniko ni safi zaidi katika mabafu ya kushirikiana. Hakikisha kikalio kinabana au kujifunga imara kwenye bakuli la choo na hakiyumbi, na tundu lake la ndani linafaa umbo la choo. Kisafishe kila siku kwa dawa ya kawaida ya kusafisha bafu. Afya inauza aina zenye kifuniko, zisizo na kifuniko na zenye vishikio kwa sababu kikalio kilichoinuliwa kiko karibu kwenye kila orodha ya vitu vya kuruhusiwa baada ya upasuaji wa mifupa."],["Discharge-checklist item with three price points and frequent bundling","Bidhaa ya orodha ya kuruhusiwa hospitalini yenye bei tatu na mara nyingi huuzwa kwa kifurushi"]],"mr_pc_seat":[["A pressure-relief seat cushion spreads body weight over a larger area, protecting the tailbone and sitting bones from pain and pressure sores. A ring (donut) cushion lifts the tailbone and perineum off the seat and suits haemorrhoids and the weeks after childbirth; a memory-foam coccyx cushion with a cut-out at the back eases tailbone and sciatic pain at desks and in cars; a gel or honeycomb cushion stays cooler in hot weather and is a sensible base for wheelchair users. People who sit in a wheelchair all day and cannot shift their weight need a properly assessed pressure cushion, plus a change of position at least every hour. Choose a washable cover and a cushion that fits the chair seat. Afya stocks ring, coccyx and gel cushions at value to premium prices.","Mto wa kukalia wa kupunguza mgandamizo hutawanya uzito wa mwili kwenye eneo kubwa zaidi, ukilinda kitokono na mifupa ya kukalia dhidi ya maumivu na vidonda vya mgandamizo. Mto wa pete huinua kitokono na msamba kutoka kitini na unafaa bawasiri na wiki za baada ya kujifungua; mto wa sponji ya kumbukumbu wa kitokono wenye tundu nyuma hupunguza maumivu ya kitokono na sciatica mezani na garini; mto wa jeli au wa umbo la sega hubaki baridi zaidi wakati wa joto na ni msingi mzuri kwa watumiaji wa kiti cha magurudumu. Watu wanaoketi kwenye kiti cha magurudumu siku nzima na wasioweza kuhamisha uzito wao wanahitaji mto wa mgandamizo uliotathminiwa ipasavyo, pamoja na kubadilisha mkao angalau kila saa. Chagua kifuniko kinachofuliwa na mto unaotoshea kiti. Afya inauza mito ya pete, ya kitokono na ya jeli kwa bei kuanzia nafuu hadi hadhi ya juu."],["Broad appeal from new mothers to office workers and wheelchair users","Mvuto mpana kuanzia akina mama wapya hadi wafanyakazi wa ofisini na watumiaji wa kiti cha magurudumu"]],"mr_pc_mattress":[["An alternating-pressure (ripple) mattress overlay is a set of air tubes laid on top of an ordinary mattress and connected to a quiet pump, which inflates and deflates alternate tubes every few minutes so no part of the skin bears pressure for long. It helps prevent pressure sores in people who are paralysed, very frail or bed-bound after a stroke or serious illness, and supports healing of early sores. It does not replace turning: the person should still be repositioned at least every two to four hours, kept clean and dry, and well nourished. Place a single thin sheet over the overlay, keep the pump on at all times and check that tubes stay inflated. A sore that is open, deep or smelly needs a nurse or doctor. Afya stocks a ripple mattress because families caring for a bed-bound relative often discover the need only after a sore appears.","Godoro la hewa la kubadilisha mgandamizo ni seti ya mirija ya hewa inayowekwa juu ya godoro la kawaida na kuunganishwa na pampu tulivu, inayojaza na kupunguza hewa katika mirija mbadala kila baada ya dakika chache ili hakuna sehemu ya ngozi inayobeba mgandamizo kwa muda mrefu. Husaidia kuzuia vidonda vya kulalia kwa watu waliopooza, dhaifu sana au waliolala kitandani baada ya kiharusi au ugonjwa mkubwa, na husaidia vidonda vya mwanzo kupona. Halichukui nafasi ya kugeuzwa: mtu bado anapaswa kubadilishwa mkao angalau kila saa mbili hadi nne, kuwekwa safi na mkavu, na kulishwa vizuri. Weka shuka moja jembamba juu ya godoro hili, acha pampu ikiwa imewashwa wakati wote na hakikisha mirija inabaki imejaa hewa. Kidonda kilicho wazi, kirefu au chenye harufu kinahitaji muuguzi au daktari. Afya inauza godoro hili kwa sababu familia zinazomuuguza ndugu aliyelala kitandani mara nyingi hugundua hitaji hili baada tu ya kidonda kutokea."],["High-value home-care device that prevents costly complications; low local competition","Kifaa cha uuguzi wa nyumbani cha thamani kubwa kinachozuia madhara ya gharama kubwa; ushindani mdogo hapa nchini"]],"mr_pc_heel":[["The heels are one of the commonest places for pressure sores in people confined to bed, because a small area of skin carries the weight of the leg. A foam heel-offloading pillow placed under the calves lets the heels float free of the mattress, while padded heel protectors (booties) cushion and reduce friction. Check the heels twice a day for redness that does not fade when pressed, which is an early warning sign, and keep the skin clean and moisturised. Avoid pillows directly under the knees for long periods unless advised, and make sure booties are not tight around the ankle. People with diabetes or poor circulation are at particular risk and need extra vigilance. Afya stocks a calf-offloading pillow and a value heel cover.","Visigino ni mojawapo ya sehemu za kawaida zaidi za vidonda vya mgandamizo kwa watu waliolazwa kitandani, kwa sababu eneo dogo la ngozi hubeba uzito wa mguu. Mto wa sponji wa kuinua visigino unaowekwa chini ya ndama huruhusu visigino kuelea bila kugusa godoro, wakati vilinda visigino vyenye mto hupunguza mgandamizo na msuguano. Kagua visigino mara mbili kwa siku kuona wekundu usiopotea ukibonyezwa, ambao ni ishara ya mapema ya hatari, na weka ngozi safi na yenye unyevu. Epuka mito moja kwa moja chini ya magoti kwa muda mrefu isipokuwa umeshauriwa, na hakikisha vilinda visigino havibani kuzunguka kifundo. Watu wenye kisukari au mzunguko hafifu wa damu wako katika hatari kubwa zaidi na wanahitaji uangalifu wa ziada. Afya inauza mto wa kuinua ndama na kifuniko cha kisigino cha bei nafuu."],["Low-cost prevention that pairs with ripple mattresses and bed pads","Kinga ya bei ndogo inayoendana na magodoro ya hewa na pedi za kitanda"]],"mr_pc_cervical":[["A cervical pillow has a contoured shape, with a higher roll under the neck and a hollow for the head, that keeps the neck in a neutral line during sleep. It suits people who wake with neck pain, stiffness or headaches, and those with neck arthritis. Back sleepers usually need the lower roll and side sleepers the higher roll, so the head stays level with the spine; stomach sleeping strains the neck whatever the pillow. Memory foam holds its shape for years and moulds to the user; choose a removable, washable cover because of heat and humidity. Allow one or two weeks to adapt. Afya stocks a regular, a contoured and a memory-foam model, because a good night’s sleep is one of the most valued outcomes for customers with pain.","Mto wa shingo una umbo lililopinda, lenye mviringo mrefu zaidi chini ya shingo na shimo kwa kichwa, unaoweka shingo kwenye mstari wa kawaida wakati wa usingizi. Unafaa watu wanaoamka na maumivu ya shingo, kukakamaa au maumivu ya kichwa, na wenye baridi yabisi ya shingo. Wanaolala chali kwa kawaida huhitaji mviringo mfupi na wanaolala ubavu mviringo mrefu, ili kichwa kibaki sawa na uti wa mgongo; kulala kifudifudi huumiza shingo bila kujali mto. Sponji ya kumbukumbu hudumisha umbo lake kwa miaka na hujifinyanga kwa mtumiaji; chagua kifuniko kinachoondolewa na kufuliwa kwa sababu ya joto na unyevu. Ruhusu wiki moja au mbili kuzoea. Afya inauza mto wa kawaida, uliopinda na wa sponji ya kumbukumbu, kwa sababu usingizi mzuri ni mojawapo ya matokeo yanayothaminiwa zaidi na wateja wenye maumivu."],["Comfort upgrade with broad appeal and good margin; strong gift item","Uboreshaji wa starehe wenye mvuto mpana na faida nzuri; zawadi nzuri"]],"mr_pc_wedge":[["A wedge pillow is a firm triangular foam support that raises the head and upper body, or the legs, at a steady angle. Raising the upper body helps people sleep after abdominal, chest or shoulder surgery, reduces night-time acid reflux and eases breathlessness from heart or lung disease; turned around, it elevates swollen legs after leg surgery or injury. Choose a height of about 20 to 30 cm for most adults and a firm, high-density foam that does not sink; a cover that unzips for washing is important in the heat. Make sure the person does not slide down the wedge, which can create friction on the lower back, and place a small pillow under the knees if needed. Afya stocks a value positioner and a premium post-surgery wedge.","Mto wa kuinua ni kishikizo imara cha sponji cha umbo la pembetatu kinachoinua kichwa na sehemu ya juu ya mwili, au miguu, kwa pembe thabiti. Kuinua sehemu ya juu ya mwili huwasaidia watu kulala baada ya upasuaji wa tumbo, kifua au bega, hupunguza kiungulia cha usiku na hupunguza kukosa pumzi kutokana na magonjwa ya moyo au mapafu; ukiugeuza, huinua miguu iliyovimba baada ya upasuaji au jeraha la mguu. Chagua urefu wa takriban sentimita 20 hadi 30 kwa watu wazima wengi na sponji imara yenye msongamano mkubwa isiyobonyea; kifuniko kinachofunguliwa kwa zipu kwa ajili ya kufua ni muhimu kwa sababu ya joto. Hakikisha mtu hateremki chini ya mto, jambo linaloweza kuleta msuguano kwenye mgongo wa chini, na weka mto mdogo chini ya magoti ikihitajika. Afya inauza mto wa bei nafuu wa kuweka mkao na mto wa hadhi ya juu wa baada ya upasuaji."],["Versatile recovery pillow with mid-to-high ticket and repeat recommendation by nurses","Mto wa kupona wenye matumizi mengi, bei ya kati hadi juu na unaopendekezwa mara kwa mara na wauguzi"]],"mr_pc_knee":[["A knee pillow is a shaped foam cushion placed between the knees when lying on the side, keeping the hips, pelvis and spine aligned so the upper leg does not drop forward and twist the lower back. It eases hip bursitis, lower-back pain, sciatica and knee arthritis at night, and is useful in pregnancy and after hip replacement, when surgeons often advise keeping the knees apart. Choose memory foam with a strap so it stays in place as you turn, and a washable cover. Back sleepers can place a pillow under the knees instead to relax the lower back. Afya stocks two shapes because a simple, affordable pillow can transform sleep for people with joint pain.","Mto wa magoti ni mto wa sponji wenye umbo maalum unaowekwa kati ya magoti ukiwa umelala ubavu, ukiweka nyonga, nyonga ya chini na uti wa mgongo kwenye mstari mmoja ili mguu wa juu usianguke mbele na kupinda mgongo wa chini. Hupunguza maumivu ya bursitis ya nyonga, mgongo wa chini, sciatica na baridi yabisi ya goti usiku, na ni muhimu wakati wa ujauzito na baada ya kubadilishwa nyonga, wakati madaktari wa upasuaji mara nyingi hushauri magoti yatenganishwe. Chagua sponji ya kumbukumbu yenye mkanda ili ubaki mahali pake unapogeuka, na kifuniko kinachofuliwa. Wanaolala chali wanaweza badala yake kuweka mto chini ya magoti ili kulegeza mgongo wa chini. Afya inauza maumbo mawili kwa sababu mto rahisi na nafuu unaweza kubadilisha usingizi wa watu wenye maumivu ya viungo."],["Affordable, giftable sleep aid that cross-sells with back and pregnancy ranges","Msaada wa usingizi nafuu unaofaa kama zawadi unaouzika pamoja na bidhaa za mgongo na ujauzito"]]};window.dispatchEvent(new Event("afyatx"));